(33, 2, '2017-03-29 04:57:19', '2017-03-29 04:57:19', '<div id=\"I33\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><img id=\"I33_img\" style=\"width: 604px; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_services.gif\" alt=\"Now offering the Express Tan\" /></div>\r\n<div id=\"I11\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I11_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h2></h2>\r\n<h2 style=\"letter-spacing: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><strong>\r\n</strong>\r\n</span></h2>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">\r\n<strong>\r\n<span style=\"font-size: xx-large;\"><span style=\"line-height: 48px;\">Sunless tanning</span></span>\r\n</strong>\r\n</span></h4>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">\r\nFirst of all, a special pre-tan moisturizer is applied to dry areas of the body .  Then, using a customized solution based on your skin tone and desired shade of color, the solution is applied to your full body via an HVLP gun. Finally, You are finished off with a special powder so there is no \"sticky\" feeling like most spray tans.....\r\n</span>\r\n</span></h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size: large;\">\r\n<strong>DHA products </strong>~\r\n</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-size: medium;\"> </span>\r\n</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">\r\nI offer 2 tan extenders that in our experience are the best on the market, one is a facial spray bronzer and the other is an all-over body creme. Both smell great and prolong your tan. Typical tan lasts two weeks with use of these products.\r\n</span></h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-style: italic; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n<strong>\r\n<span style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"> </span>\r\n</strong>\r\n</span>\r\n</span></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I214\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I214_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Courier New\', monospace;\">Cash Transactions Only !</span>\r\n</span></h2>\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I35\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><img id=\"I35_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/pricing.gif\" alt=\"Pricing\" /></div>\r\n<div id=\"I135\" class=\"Layout1_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"Left_I135\" style=\"text-align: left; vertical-align: top; width: 49.17218543046358%; padding: 0;\">\r\n<div id=\"I137\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0 0 0 0;\">\r\n<div id=\"I137_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size: large;\">\r\n<u>\r\n<b>Full Body Session</b>\r\n</u>\r\n</span>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kelly\'s Tanning Studio: </span>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">\r\n<i>\r\n<b>\r\n<span style=\"font-size: large;\">Mclean, VA</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-size: large;\">:</span>\r\n</b>\r\n</i></span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">\r\n</span></p>\r\n\r\n$60\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; text-align: center; font-size: medium;\">\r\n<i>Children are always welcome !</i>\r\n</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div></td>\r\n<td id=\"Right_I135\" style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 50.82781456953642%; padding: 0;\">\r\n<div id=\"I138\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I138_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: large;\"><b>Full Body Session</b></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Your location</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">:</span>\r\n</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-style: italic;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Washington, DC:</span></h5>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Georgetown and Spring Valley ~$110</span></h5>\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">All Other areas~$120-140</span></h5>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I140\" class=\"Horizontal_Line_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; marg