your skin and shave prior to the <span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">appointment. Use a nongreasy scrub like DermaDoctor KP Duty Body Scrub. </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">This promotes even coverage and lengthens the duration of your tan by </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">removing dead skin that would otherwise flake off. </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">Do not wear makeup, moisturizer, deodorant, lotions, etc. which can act as </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">a barrier to the spray and stops the process from working properly. While not necessary, wearing flip flops and dark, loose fitting clothing and undergarments to your appointment is helpful.  </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">If your appointment is on location, a tan pop up tent will be available of you  desire not to tan in a walk-in shower (the best option for light).</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">You </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">can choose to be dressed (or not)~ most clients wear a bathing suit, </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">but disposable bottoms are provided if desired. A disposable hair cap </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">will also be provided. The topical bronzer may rub off on clothing but </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">it will wash out of most fabrics.</span></div>\r\n<div id=\"I8\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I8_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">**String bikinis are not recommended because they can leave uneven lines...\r\n</span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I53\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><img id=\"I53_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_afterSession.gif\" />Wait at least 8 hours before showering, exercising( for best results), or using a pool. (don’t get caught in the rain after!!) Most importantly, moisturize morning and evening on a daily basis after your first shower. Avoid Dove soap and moisturizers containing AHA (Alpha Hydroxy Acid), retinols, and lactic acid. Also avoid exfoliating and long hot showers and baths~ excessive cleansing can dull the affects. Chlorine in pools and hot tubs can decrease the longevity of your tan too.</div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\">For best results, use a tan extender with DHA, which is available for purchase at the time of your appointment.</div>\r\n<div id=\"I162\" class=\"Panel_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px;\"></div>', 'FAQ', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '14-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-11-20 20:56:38', '2017-11-20 20:56:38', '', 14, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/14-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(123, 2, '2017-11-20 14:19:15', '2017-11-20 14:19:15', '<div id=\"I52\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\">\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<img id=\"I52_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_whySunless.gif\" />\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I44\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I44_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h5 style=\"color: #330000; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\">We are now aware of the sun’s harmful effects and damage to our skin. As a result,, more and more people are opting for UV free sunless tanning. In under 20 minutes you can have a safe and beautiful tan, achieving the same results as countless days in the sun, without the aging\r\neffects.  </span></span></h5>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I42\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\">How is your tan achieved?<img id=\"I42_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_whatIsAirbrush.gif\" /></div>\r\n<div id=\"I45\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I45_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">This tan is achieved throught a  technician who will spray DHA tanning formula onto your body. </span>The <span style=\"font-size: small;\">FDA approved dihydroxyaceton (DHA) reacts with the amino acids in the</span><span style=\"font-size: small;\">outermost layer of the skin. When DHA is combined with the amino acids in </span>your skin, it reacts by giving your skin a tan appearance. <span style=\"font-size: small;\">If you are pregnant, please </span><span style=\"font-size: small;\">have your physician approve.</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I49\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I49_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000;\">What is the solution that you use?</p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: small;\">The solution used during your session is customized and based on your skin tone and  your desired color intensity. In addition, our solutions contain a bronzer, a temporary coloring agent, which washes off leaving behind your sunless tan. It takes approximately 3 to 24hours after the session for the solution to fully tan your skin, depending of the solution you choose. </span><span style=\"font-size: small;\">\r\n</span></p>\r\nThe tan lasts between 7-10 days, but it really depends on your skin type and how well you moisturize after. However,this can be extended by using a tan extender containing DHA, which will prolong the tan. Tan extenders are available for purchase at the time of your appointment.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I48\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I48_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I56\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><img id=\"I56_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_howPrepare.gif\" />Pre and Post care directives for spray tans</div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">It </span>is best to lightly exfoliate your skin and shave prior to the <span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">appointment. Use a nongreasy scrub like DermaDoctor KP Duty Body Scrub. </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">This promotes even coverage and lengthens the duration of your tan by </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">removing dead skin that would otherwise flake off. </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">Do not wear makeup, moisturizer, deodorant, lotions, etc. which can act as</span></div>\r\n<div id=\"I58\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I58_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\"> a barrier to the spray and stops the process from working properly. While not necessary, wearing flip flops and dark, loose fitting clothing and undergarments to your appointment is helpful.  </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">If your appointment is on location, a tan pop up tent will be available of you  desire not to tan in a walk-in shower (the best option for light).</span>You <span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">can choose to be dressed (or not)~ most clients wear a bathing suit, </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">but disposable bottoms are provided if desired. A disposable hair cap </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">will also be provided. The topical bronzer may rub off on clothing but </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">it will wash out of most fabrics.</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I8\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I8_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">**String bikinis are not recommended because they can leave uneven lines...\r\n</span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I53\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><img id=\"I53_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_afterSession.gif\" />Wait at least 8 hours before showering, exercising, or using a pool. (don’t get caught in the rain after!!) Most importantly, moisturize morning and evening on a daily basis after your first shower. Avoid Dove soap and moisturizers containing AHA (Alpha Hydroxy Acid), retinols, and lactic acid. Also avoid exfoliating and long hot showers and baths~ excessive cleansing can dull the affects. Chlorine in pools and hot tubs can decrease the longevity of your tan too.</div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\">For best results, use a tan extender with DHA, which is available for purchase at the time of your appointment.</div>\r\n<div id=\"I162\" class=\"Panel_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px;\"></div>', 'FAQ', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '14-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-11-20 14:19:15', '2017-11-20 14:19:15', '', 14, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/14-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(121, 2, '2017-11-20 14:16:24', '2017-11-20 14:16:24', '<div id=\"I52\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\">\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<img id=\"I52_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_whySunless.gif\" />\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I44\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I44_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h5 style=\"color: #330000; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\">We are now aware of the sun’s harmful effects and damage to our skin. As a result,, more and more people are opting for UV free sunless tanning. In under 20 minutes you can have a safe and beautiful tan, achieving the same results as countless days in the sun, without the aging\r\neffects.  </span></span></h5>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I42\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\">How is your tan achieved?<img id=\"I42_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_whatIsAirbrush.gif\" /></div>\r\n<div id=\"I45\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I45_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">This tan is achieved throught a  technician who will spray DHA tanning formula onto your body. </span>The <span style=\"font-size: small;\">FDA approved dihydroxyaceton (DHA) reacts with the amino acids in the</span><span style=\"font-size: small;\">outermost layer of the skin. When DHA is combined with the amino acids in </span>your skin, it reacts by giving your skin a tan appearance. <span style=\"font-size: small;\">If you are pregnant, please </span><span style=\"font-size: small;\">have your physician approve.</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I49\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I49_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000;\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000;\">What is the solution that you use?</p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: small;\">The solution used during your session is customized and based on your skin tone and  your desired color intensity. In addition, our solutions contain a bronzer, a temporary coloring agent, which washes off leaving behind your sunless tan. It takes approximately 3 to 24hours after the session for the solution to fully tan your skin, depending of the solution you choose. </span><span style=\"font-size: small;\">\r\n</span></p>\r\nThe tan lasts between 7-10 days, but it really depends on your skin type and how well you moisturize after. However,this can be extended by using a tan extender containing DHA, which will prolong the tan. Tan extenders are available for purchase at the time of your appointment.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I48\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I48_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I56\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><img id=\"I56_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_howPrepare.gif\" />Pre and Post care directives for spray tans</div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">It </span>is best to lightly exfoliate your skin and shave prior to the <span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">appointment. Use a nongreasy scrub like DermaDoctor KP Duty Body Scrub. </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">This promotes even coverage and lengthens the duration of your tan by </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">removing dead skin that would otherwise flake off. </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">Do not wear makeup, moisturizer, deodorant, lotions, etc. which can act as</span></div>\r\n<div id=\"I58\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I58_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\"> a barrier to the spray and stops the process from working properly. While not necessary, wearing flip flops and dark, loose fitting clothing and undergarments to your appointment is helpful.  </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">If your appointment is on location, a tan pop up tent will be available of you  desire not to tan in a walk-in shower (the best option for light).</span>You <span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">can choose to be dressed (or not)~ most clients wear a bathing suit, </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">but disposable bottoms are provided if desired. A disposable hair cap </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">will also be provided. The topical bronzer may rub off on clothing but </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">it will wash out of most fabrics.</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I8\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I8_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">**String bikinis are not recommended because they can leave uneven lines...\r\n</span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I53\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><img id=\"I53_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_afterSession.gif\" />Wait at least 8 hours before showering, exercising, or using a pool. (don’t get caught in the rain after!!) Most importantly, moisturize morning and evening on a daily basis after your first shower. Avoid Dove soap and moisturizers containing AHA (Alpha Hydroxy Acid), retinols, and lactic acid. Also avoid exfoliating and long hot showers and baths~ excessive cleansing can dull the affects. Chlorine in pools and hot tubs can decrease the longevity of your tan too.</div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\">For best results, use a tan extender with DHA, which is available for purchase at the time of your appointment.</div>\r\n<div id=\"I162\" class=\"Panel_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px;\"></div>', 'FAQ', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '14-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-11-20 14:16:24', '2017-11-20 14:16:24', '', 14, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/14-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(74, 2, '2017-11-03 15:28:30', '2017-11-03 15:28:30', '<div id=\"I52\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\">\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<img id=\"I52_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_whySunless.gif\" /></div>\r\n<div id=\"I44\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I44_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h5 style=\"color: #330000; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\">We are now aware of the sun’s harmful effects and damage to our skin. As a result,, more and more people are opting for UV free sunless tanning. In under 20 minutes you can have a safe and beautiful tan, achieving the same results as countless days in the sun, without the aging\r\neffects.  </span></span></h5>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I42\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><img id=\"I42_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_whatIsAirbrush.gif\" /></div>\r\n<div id=\"I45\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I45_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">This tan is achieved throught a  technician who will spray DHA tanning formula onto your body. </span>The <span style=\"font-size: small;\">FDA approved dihydroxyaceton (DHA) reacts with the amino acids in the</span><span style=\"font-size: small;\">outermost layer of the skin. When DHA is combined with the amino acids in </span>your skin, it reacts by giving your skin a tan appearance. <span style=\"font-size: small;\">Allergic reactions are rare, but consult with your physician before your </span><span style=\"font-size: small;\">appointment should you have any concerns. If you are pregnant, please </span><span style=\"font-size: small;\">have your physician approve.</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I49\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I49_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: small;\">The solution used during your session is customized and based on your skin tone and  your desired color intensity. In addition, our solutions contain a bronzer, a temporary coloring agent, which washes off leaving behind your sunless tan. It takes approximately 6 hours after the session for the solution to fully tan your skin.</span><span style=\"font-size: small;\">\r\n</span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I54\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><img id=\"I54_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_HowLong.gif\" /></div>\r\n<div id=\"I48\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I48_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The tan lasts between 7-10 days, but it really depends on your skin type and how well you moisturize after. However,this can be extended by using a tan extender containing DHA, which will prolong the tan. Tan extenders are available for purchase at the time of your appointment.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I56\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><img id=\"I56_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_howPrepare.gif\" /></div>\r\n<div id=\"I58\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I58_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">It </span>is best to lightly exfoliate your skin and shave prior to the <span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">appointment. Use a nongreasy scrub like DermaDoctor KP Duty Body Scrub. </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">This promotes even coverage and lengthens the duration of your tan by </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">removing dead skin that would otherwise flake off. </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">Do not wear makeup, moisturizer, deodorant, lotions, etc. which can act as\r\na barrier to the spray and stops the process from working properly. While not necessary, wearing flip flops and dark, loose fitting clothing and undergarments to your appointment is helpful.  </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">If your appointment is on location, a tan pop up tent will be available of you  desire not to tan in a walk-in shower (the best option for light).</span>You <span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">can choose to be dressed (or not)~ most clients wear a bathing suit, </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">but disposable bottoms are provided if desired. A disposable hair cap </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">will also be provided. The topical bronzer may rub off on clothing but </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">it will wash out of most fabrics.</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I8\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I8_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">**String bikinis are not recommended because they can leave uneven lines...\r\n</span></p>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I53\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><img id=\"I53_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_afterSession.gif\" /></div>\r\n<div id=\"I46\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I46_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Wait at least 8 hours before showering, exercising, or using a pool. (don’t get caught in the rain after!!) Most importantly, moisturize morning and evening on a daily basis after your first shower. Avoid Dove soap and moisturizers containing AHA (Alpha Hydroxy Acid), retinols, and lactic acid. Also avoid exfoliating and long hot showers and baths~ excessive cleansing can dull the affects. Chlorine in pools and hot tubs can decrease the longevity of your tan too. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\">For best results, use a tan extender with DHA, which is available for purchase at the time of your appointment.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I162\" class=\"Panel_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px;\"></div>', 'FAQ', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '14-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-11-03 15:28:30', '2017-11-03 15:28:30', '', 14, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/14-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
