(36, 2, '2017-03-29 05:16:35', '2017-03-29 05:16:35', '<div id=\"I31\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><img id=\"I31_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/discover.gif\" alt=\"Discover a new level of sunless tanning\" /></div>\r\n<div id=\"I30\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0 0 0 0;\">\r\n<div id=\"I30_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\r\n</span>Mobile spray tan and spa services in the comfort of your own home! </span></h2>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"> ``Feel the Miami glow, even during the Canadian winter``<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; color: #330000;\">\r\n</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; color: #330000;\">Miami Touch Tanning and Spa is the premier mobile airbrush tanning company in Toronto, ON. Nationally recognized as the best in the area, we provide customized solutions to our clients, who include celebrities, bodybuilders, moms, and others looking for a natural looking long lasting tan. We are also very proud to offer you many other services related to beauty. You can chose between an infratherapy session, a therapeutic massage, a keratin hair treatment, some teeth whitening, and even a set of new hair extensions.\r\n</span>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">\r\n<b>\r\n<s