 \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">\r\nAfter testing dozens of solutions from all over the world, we discovered the finest solution that will give you a natural, instant tan (in 10 minutes!) and will last up to ten days. You can depend on us for that bronzed, healthy look when time is of the essence and perfection is required. Sunless Tanning and Spa\r\n</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">\r\nprovides professional, personalized service right to your front door. Upon request, we bring a pop up tent so there is no mess. There is no waiting and no uncomfortable settings. Our service is safe and is done in the privacy of whatever location you choose: home, office, hotel, or at special events.\r\n</span>\r\n</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-03-29 05:16:35', '2017-03-29 05:16:35', '', 6, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/6-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
