(66, 2, '2017-05-25 17:07:02', '2017-05-25 17:07:02', '<div id=\"I31\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><img id=\"I31_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/discover.gif\" alt=\"Discover a new level of sunless tanning\" /></div>\r\n<div id=\"I30\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0 0 0 0;\">\r\n<div id=\"I30_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\r\n</span>Mobile spray tan and spa services in the comfort of your own home! </span></h2>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"> Feel the <strong><em>Miami glow,</em></strong> even during the Canadian winter!<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; color: #330000;\">\r\n</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; color: #330000;\">Miami Touch Tanning and Spa is the premier mobile airbrush tanning company in Toronto, ON.  Recognized as the best in the area, we provide customized solutions to our clients, who include celebrities, bodybuilders, moms, and others looking for a natural looking long lasting tan. We are also very proud to offer you many other services related to beauty. You can choose between an infratherapy session, a therapeutic massage, a keratin hair treatment, some teeth whitening, or even a set of new hair extensions. You can also combine multiple treatment at the same time to your convenience.\r\n</span>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\">Mobile Services</span>\r\n</b>\r\n</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">Customized solutions</span></span></span></b></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">    </span>\r\n</span>\r\n</span>Norvel products   </b></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b>                                                                          </b></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b>1) Premium Norvel: This bronzer does not have an immediate visible effect but begin to react with the skin after application. This solution does not contain consmetic bronzers, but only DHA which react with the amino acids in your skin to create the darkening reaction of tan.</b> </span><b>\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">2) 1 hour rapid tan:\r\n<span style=\"color: #330022;\">Group discounts------ see or prices page</span>\r\n</span>\r\n</b><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">\r\n<b>\r\n<span style=\"color: #330022;\">c100% Satisfaction Guaranteed</span>\r\n</b>\r\n</span></li>\r\n 	<li><b>\r\n<span style=\"color: #330022; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">Service Areas: Greater Toronto Area and <span style=\"line-height: 30px;\">surrounding</span> areas.</span></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I120\" class=\"Horizontal_Line_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px;\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"I2\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0px;\">\r\n<div id=\"I2_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000;\"><span style=\"color: #330022; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nAirbrush tanning is one of the safest and healthiest way of achieving a beautiful tan......\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">\r\nAfter testing dozens of solutions from all over the world, we discovered the finest solution that will give you a natural, instant tan (in 10 minutes!) and will last up to ten days. You can depend on us for that bronzed, healthy look when time is of the essence and perfection is required. Sunless Tanning and Spa\r\n</span>\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">\r\nprovides professional, personalized service right to your front door. Upon request, we bring a pop up tent so there is no mess. There is no waiting and no uncomfortable settings. Our service is safe and is done in the privacy of whatever location you choose: home, office, hotel, or at special events.\r\n</span>\r\n</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-05-25 17:07:02', '2017-05-25 17:07:02', '', 6, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/6-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
