46\">\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<div id=\"Panel_I146\" style=\"text-align: left; vertical-align: top; margin: 0 auto;\">\r\n<div id=\"I147\" class=\"Layout1_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"Left_I147\" style=\"text-align: left; vertical-align: top; width: 50%; padding: 0;\"></td>\r\n<td id=\"Right_I147\" style=\"vertical-align: top; width: 50%; padding: 0;\">\r\n<div id=\"I184\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"I150\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0 0 0 0;\">\r\n<div id=\"I150_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\'; font-size: x-large; background-color: #ffffff;\">2 ladies~ 15% off </span></h4>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I178\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 15px 15px 15px 15px;\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"I151\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0 0 0 0;\">\r\n<div id=\"I151_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center; color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\';\">3 ladies~ 30% off</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\';\"> </span></span></h5>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I179\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 15px 15px 15px 15px;\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"I152\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0 0 0 0;\">\r\n<div id=\"I152_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center; color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\';\">4 ladies~</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\'; font-size: x-large; background-color: #ffffff;\">40% off</span></h5>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I180\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center; color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\';\">5 ladies +</span></span><span style=\"font-size: x-large; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\';\">~ host receives a free spray tan</span></span></h5>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\"></div></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I88\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: center;\"><img id=\"I88_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_parties.gif\" /></div>\r\n<div id=\"I89\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I89_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">Sunless Tanning and Spa provides Wedding and Tan Parties!</span></h4>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: large;\">Large discounts are given to groups. Examples include pre-prom, bachelorette parties, girls night in, birthday parties, and\r\nmuch more!!! Just call us, we will give you an excellent price according to our quality procedures.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\">** Brides must schedule a trial tan prior to wedding.</span></em></span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I224\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"I223\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\"></div>', 'Prices', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '10-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-11-06 08:24:56', '2017-11-06 08:24:56', '', 10, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/10-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(87, 2, '2017-11-06 08:33:07', '2017-11-06 08:33:07', '<strong><span style=\"color: #993366;\"><em>All the members of our team are more than welcome to offer all the services available in the comfort of your own home, at very affordable prices and with the best quality guarantee.</em></span></strong>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Our CEO Jan B: </strong>\r\n\r\n<img class=\" wp-image-182 alignleft\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/ceo-207x300.jpg\" alt=\"ceo\" width=\"213\" height=\"309\" />\r\n\r\nCurrently based in Toronto, Jan had the chance to live and visit Miami since she is 21 years old. She has always loved the Miami glow and this is what she wants to bring to everyone in Toronto. Jan believes that the most important in the beauty business is the quality of the service provided. She has received a specific training from the best spray tan proffesionals in Canada. She is specialized in body contouring(a technique that allows you to enchance a specific part of your body like create more definition on your  abs, your chest, your arms....), she also have fallowed a course with certification that allow her to practice body massages, full body waxing and body wraps treatments.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong> Our hair stylist Christina P:\r\n</strong>\r\n\r\n<img class=\" wp-image-176 alignleft\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/sunless20-220x300.jpg\" alt=\"sunless20\" width=\"211\" height=\"288\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nHere is a little about our hair stylist Chriss: She is a Highly Certified hair extensions Technician, Hairstylist and Color Technicia, having attended the prestigious FIORIO Hair Academy in Toronto. Christina is working in both Toronto and Durham Region, and specialised in Tape-in, Fusion and microbead methods of extensions. You can either supply your own hair on invest in GBB hair, Grade 7a+hair. Top rated 100% human Remi Hair extensions, used by Toronto Celebretry Extensionists. She specializes in balayage, color melts and ombre.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Our medical estestichian Khalid M:</strong>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\" wp-image-177 alignleft\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/sunless24-169x300.png\" alt=\"sunless24\" width=\"189\" height=\"335\" />\r\n\r\nKhalid is an award winning Medical Aesthetician and a proffesional Makeup artist. He graduated with from Marca College with distinction and  the most prestigious Dermalogica student of the Year award. He offers all medical esthetics services including facials, Swedish and Lymphatic drainage massages, full body waxing, body wrap and slimming treatment and finally, party and bridal makeup services. All of these services can be done in the confort of your own home without any need to travel to a specific location.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong> </strong>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"size-medium wp-image-180 aligncenter\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/testimonials-4-300x175.jpg\" alt=\"testimonials (4)\" width=\"300\" height=\"175\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<p class=\"w\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">March 2017</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #332200; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: medium;\">The Best of the Best: Miami touch sunless </span><span style=\"color: #332200; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: medium;\">Tanning spa</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #332200; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: medium;\">\"Her at-home airbrushing leaves skin glowing\". All combined with some infratherapy, it\'s like the perfect combo for anyone that want to look fresh all year round. Plus, packages are available.</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">--------</div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<div id=\"I80\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0px 0px 0px 10px;\">\r\n<div id=\"I80_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\">\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans; text-align: center;\">Khalid is a rare pearl, his hands are magic and this was the best lymphatic draining massage i ever had. He took his time and i ve never felt rushed or anything. I also bought a package of body wraps witch also were beyond my expectetions.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans; text-align: center;\">Maria. L</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans; text-align: center;\">-------</p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans; text-align: center;\">Their hair stylist Chriss is awsome! She will take all the time needed to find the perfect color of hair extensions to match your hair and will also, if needed, color and cut your hair for an amazing match!</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans; text-align: center;\">Antonela .P</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">InStyle Magazine</span></u></span></span></span></span>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">                 </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">  </span></span></span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #330000;\">\" A certified spray tan technician can be in and out the door in 30 minutes, or she\'ll even bring\r\nan extra-special delivery: yummy margaritas and fajitas for a bronzing\r\nbash with your friends.\"</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p class=\"w\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Top Spray tanners in Ontario</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"w\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\"When\r\nshe arrived at our house..she worked quickly...her formula created\r\na believable bronze that lasted for nine days and a feeling that we\r\ncould get used to this kind of service.\" It\'s a total Vip kind of service in the tan industry.</span></span></span></p>', 'Our team and testemonials', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'our-team', '', '', '2017-11-21 17:15:17', '2017-11-21 17:15:17', '', 0, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/?page_id=87', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(88, 2, '2017-11-06 08:33:07', '2017-11-06 08:33:07', '', 'Our team', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '87-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-11-06 08:33:07', '2017-11-06 08:33:07', '', 87, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/87-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(110, 2, '2017-11-15 21:01:46', '2017-11-15 21:01:46', '<ul>\r\n 	<li id=\"I31\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><img id=\"I31_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/discover.gif\" alt=\"Discover a new level of sunless tanning\" /></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div id=\"I30\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0 0 0 0;\">\r\n<div id=\"I30_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\r\n</span>Mobile spray tan, spa services, and hair extensions all at once in the comfort of your own home! </span></h2>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"> Feel the <strong><em>Miami glow,</em></strong> even during the Canadian winter!<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; color: #330000;\">\r\n</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; color: #330000;\">Miami Touch Tanning and Spa is the premier mobile airbrush tanning, spa services and hair extensions services all combined  in Toronto, ON.  Recognized as the best in the area, we provide customized solutions to our clients, who include celebrities, bodybuilders, moms, and others looking for a natural looking long lasting tan. We are also very proud to offer you many other services related to beauty. You can choose between an infratherapy session, a therapeutic massage, body waxing, facials,  keratin hair treatment, some teeth whitening, or even a set of new hair extensions. You can also combine multiple treatment at the same time to your convenience.\r\n</span>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\">Mobile Services</span>\r\n</b>\r\n</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">Customized solutions</span></span></span></b></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">    </span>\r\n</span>\r\n</span>Norvel products( spray tan)  </b></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b>                                                                                                          </b></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b>1) Premium Norvel: This bronzer does not have an immediate visible effect but begin to react with the skin after application. This solution does not contain consmetic bronzers, but only DHA which react with the amino acids in your skin to create the darkening reaction of tan.</b>   </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">                      </span><b>\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">2) 1 hour rapid tan:  Designed for all skin tones, clients can      rinse within 1hour for light bronze, 2 hours for medium bronze and 3 hours for darkest bronze. Color will continue to develope for 24 hours.                               </span></b>\r\n\r\n<b><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">     3) Venetian,  just off the beach mediterranean  color: If you     desire an exotic look, this is the perfect choice for you. This color works with all skin colors, to acheive a darker, deeper, and exotic tan.</span></b>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<strong>4) Competition black out: </strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>5) Norvel organic: If you are an adept of organic products, this is the right one for you. This formula contains certified organic aloe and is formuled with time release moisturization and specific antioxidants.  Paraben free, Gluten free , Sulfate free( like all the other Norvel products) but also 100% Vegan and with a fragrance from Natural Extracts.\r\n</strong>\r\n<div id=\"I30_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><b><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"> <span style=\"color: #330022;\">Group discounts------ see or prices page</span>\r\n</span>\r\n</b><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">\r\n<b>\r\n<span style=\"color: #330022;\">100%Satisfaction Guaranteed</span>\r\n</b>\r\n</span><b>\r\n<span style=\"color: #330022; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">Service Areas: Greater Toronto Area and <span style=\"line-height: 30px;\">surrounding</span> areas.</span></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I120\" class=\"Horizontal_Line_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px;\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"I2\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0px;\">\r\n<div id=\"I2_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000;\"><span style=\"color: #330022; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nAirbrush tanning is one of the safest and healthiest way of achieving a beautiful tan......\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">\r\nAfter testing dozens of solutions from all over the world, we discovered the finest solution that will give you a natural, instant tan (in 10 minutes!) and will last up to ten days. You can depend on us for that bronzed, healthy look when time is of the essence and perfection is required. Sunless Tanning and Spa</span> <span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">provides professional, personalized service right to your front door. Upon request, we bring a pop up tent so there is no mess. There is no waiting and no uncomfortable settings. Our service is safe and is done in the privacy of whatever location you choose: home, office, hotel, or at special events.</span>\r\n</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000;\">We also work with a color-cut and hair extensions specialist for all your hair mobile services. Furthermore, a winning award medical Aestetichian will provide you the best mobile spa services in the GTA , all along with our CEO that also has some specific trainings in spray tans, infratherapy, theet whitening, keratin treatment, massage therapy and body wraps.</p>', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-11-15 21:01:46', '2017-11-15 21:01:46', '', 6, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/6-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(98, 2, '2017-11-09 21:39:39', '2017-11-09 21:39:39', '<div id=\"I33\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><img id=\"I33_img\" style=\"width: 604px; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_services.gif\" alt=\"Now offering the Express Tan\" /></div>\r\n<div id=\"I11\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I11_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h2></h2>\r\n<h2 style=\"letter-spacing: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><strong>\r\n</strong>\r\n</span></h2>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">\r\n<strong>\r\n<span style=\"font-size: xx-large;\"><span style=\"line-height: 48px;\">Sunless tanning</span></span>\r\n</strong>\r\n</span></h4>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">\r\nFirst of all, a special pre-tan moisturizer is applied to dry areas of the body .  Then, using a customized solution based on your skin tone and desired shade of color, the solution is applied to your full body via an HVLP gun. Finally, You are finished off with a special powder so there is no \"sticky\" feeling like most spray tans.....\r\n</span>\r\n</span></h3>\r\n</div>\r\nA different lotion will be applied depending of the level of darkness that you want to achieve. It\'s very important never to forget that each individual is different and that one product that gives you very good results may not be the best for someone else.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>DHA products </strong>~</span></span>\r\n<div id=\"I11\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I11_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size: medium;\"> Post tan care is one of the most important factor on how your spray tan application will last. A minimal investment in the good aftercare will save you money in long term. However, never start to moiziture until after your  first shower. Norvel sunless color extender PROLONG is the product that i recommend to everyone that wants to keep a flawless and long lasting tan.</span></span></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none fbHeader\"><span id=\"aboutTheProductText\" class=\"a-size-medium\">About the product</span></div>\r\n<div id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section collapsedFeatureBullets showAllFeatureBullets\">\r\n<div id=\"fbExpandableSection\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\">\r\n<div id=\"fbExpandableSectionContent\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\">\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\">\r\n 	<li class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Build and extend your sunless tan</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Time release micro capsules</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Advanced DHA odor encapsulation</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Use Daily</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Paraben Free, Gluten Free, 100% Vegan</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<div id=\"I11\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I11_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Infratherapy</strong> </span></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nWhat is it?                                                                   Have you ever run 5km without moving your feet? You can burn up to 900 calories per session in the comfort of your home.The totally safe infrared waves penetrate the muscles and cause    up to three times higher than in traditional saunas. Your body will be covered in a film of detoxifying organic herbs or in a thermogenic burning cream( depending on your choice) and then enveloped in an infrared covering to eliminate toxins and boost circulation.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nWhat are the benefits of it:\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n-  Body detoxification, eliminate toxins\r\n\r\n-Activate body circulation.\r\n\r\n-Weight loss, anti-cellulite: ideal for thinning down.\r\n\r\nResults are noticeable after 3 to 5 sessions.\r\n\r\nRelieve muscle pain : smooths arthritis, fibromyalgia and rheumatism. For muscle pain, the relief is immediate.\r\n\r\nReduce stress and fatigue.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 21.6px;\">teeth </span>whitening</b></span>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nThe procedure:  A safe whitening gel is applied to the teeth using a tray, then an LED professional portable light is placed in front of the costumer\'s teeth and runs for 15 to 20 minutes per treatment. It\'s important to know that a real medical LED is used, not the ones that you see for at home use.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nBenefits:         You will see an imporovment from the first appointment, and it will continue to whiten after each session. It\'s imortant to remember that the product that we use is safe for the dental enamel and won\'t damage it.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Keratin hair treatment: </strong>\r\n\r\nAlso known as the Brazilian keratin treatment, this treatment instantly strengthens, smooths,repairs and condition damaged hair. The products that we use restore split ends, breakage and dryness using moisture rich ingredients. Results usually last between 4 to 7 months. It can also straighten dramatically curly hair, but it\'s more often used for restoration of damaged hair. The amazing results will leave hair elastic, flexible, and soft, with a naturally vibrant shine.\r\n\r\nWe also offer an other formula without formaldehyde. Formeldehyde could be harmful in a long term use according to some studies but only if the vapor is inhaled. It\'s at your discretion to choose which product you want to use, but we will always be there to advise you and respond to your questions.\r\n<h1 id=\"title\" class=\"a-size-large a-spacing-none\"></h1>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h1 id=\"title\" class=\"a-size-large a-spacing-none\"></h1>\r\n<strong>Massage therapy  </strong>\r\n\r\nRelax, we will come to you!\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nWe bring quality Massage Therapy in your home, office or hotel.  We invite you to enjoy a unique mobile massage therapy experience in the comfort and privacy of your home, hotel,office...This is a perfect way to relax your mind, body, and spirit without having to coordinate location or availability.\r\n\r\nWe offer and specialize in ether  swedish, lymphatic drainage, deep tissue massage or reflexology.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Body wraps and slimming treatments:</strong>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Bridal makeup</strong>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Body waxing:</strong>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<div id=\"I11\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I11_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"> Hair extentions and</h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\">  Our business values quality over quantity and this is every different aspects of the services that we provide. That\'s why we work with a certified hair stylist that has recivied a doploma from a hight rated school in Toronto.</h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"></h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"></h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I11\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I11_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<div id=\"rpd\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none burj\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"messages\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none burj\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"hqp-bottom\" class=\"a-section burj\"></div>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-style: italic; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n<strong>\r\n<span style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"> </span>\r\n</strong>\r\n</span>\r\n</span></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I214\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I214_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Courier New\', monospace;\">Cash Transactions Only !</span>\r\n</span></h2>\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I175\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 15px 15px 15px 15px;\">\r\n<div id=\"I175_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\'; font-size: small;\"><b>(</b></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I146\" class=\"Panel_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px;\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"I88\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: center;\"><img id=\"I88_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_parties.gif\" /></div>\r\n<div id=\"I89\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I89_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">Sunless Tanning and Spa provides Wedding and Tan Parties!</span></h4>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: large;\">Large\r\ndiscounts are given to groups. Examples include pre-prom, divorce\r\nparties, bachelorette parties, girls night in, birthday parties, and\r\nmuch more!!</span></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\">** Brides must schedule a trial tan prior to wedding.</span></em></span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Services', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '8-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-11-09 21:39:39', '2017-11-09 21:39:39', '', 8, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/8-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
