=\"font-weight: normal;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size: medium;\"> Post tan care is one of the most important factor on how your spray tan application will last. A minimal investment in the good aftercare will save you money in long term. However, never start to moiziture until after your  first shower. Norvel sunless color extender PROLONG is the product that i recommend to everyone that wants to keep a flawless and long lasting tan.</span></span></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none fbHeader\"><span id=\"aboutTheProductText\" class=\"a-size-medium\">About the product</span></div>\r\n<div id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section collapsedFeatureBullets showAllFeatureBullets\">\r\n<div id=\"fbExpandableSection\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\">\r\n<div id=\"fbExpandableSectionContent\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\">\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\">\r\n 	<li class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Build and extend your sunless tan</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Time release micro capsules</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Advanced DHA odor encapsulation</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Use Daily</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Paraben Free, Gluten Free, 100% Vegan</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<div id=\"I11\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I11_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Infratherapy</strong> </span></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nWhat is it?                                                                   Have you ever run 5km without moving your feet? You can burn up to 900 calories per session in the comfort of your home.The totally safe infrared waves penetrate the muscles and cause    up to three times higher than in traditional saunas. Your body will be covered in a film of detoxifying organic herbs or in a thermogenic burning cream( depending on your choice) and then enveloped in an infrared covering to eliminate toxins and boost circulation.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nWhat are the benefits of it:\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n-  Body detoxification, eliminate toxins\r\n\r\n-Activate body circulation.\r\n\r\n-Weight loss, anti-cellulite: ideal for thinning down.\r\n\r\nResults are noticeable after 3 to 5 sessions.\r\n\r\nRelieve muscle pain : smooths arthritis, fibromyalgia and rheumatism. For muscle pain, the relief is immediate.\r\n\r\nReduce stress and fatigue.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 21.6px;\">teeth </span>whitening</b></span>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nThe procedure:  A safe whitening gel is applied to the teeth using a tray, then an LED professional portable light is placed in front of the costumer\'s teeth and runs for 15 to 20 minutes per treatment. It\'s important to know that a real medical LED is used, not the ones that you see for at home use.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nBenefits:         You will see an imporovment from the first appointment, and it will continue to whiten after each session. It\'s imortant to remember that the product that we use is safe for the dental enamel and won\'t damage it.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Keratin hair treatment: </strong>\r\n\r\nAlso known as the Brazilian keratin treatment, this treatment instantly strengthens, smooths,repairs and condition damaged hair. The products that we use restore split ends, breakage and dryness using moisture rich ingredients. Results usually last between 4 to 7 months. It can also straighten dramatically curly hair, but it\'s more often used for restoration of damaged hair. The amazing results will leave hair elastic, flexible, and soft, with a naturally vibrant shine.\r\n\r\nWe also offer an other formula without formaldehyde. Formeldehyde could be harmful in a long term use according to some studies but only if the vapor is inhaled. It\'s at your discretion to choose which product you want to use, but we will always be there to advise you and respond to your questions.\r\n<h1 id=\"title\" class=\"a-size-large a-spacing-none\"></h1>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h1 id=\"title\" class=\"a-size-large a-spacing-none\"></h1>\r\n<strong>Massage therapy  </strong>\r\n\r\nRelax, we will come to you!\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nWe bring quality Massage Therapy in your home, office or hotel.  We invite you to enjoy a unique mobile massage therapy experience in the comfort and privacy of your home, hotel,office...This is a perfect way to relax your mind, body, and spirit without having to coordinate location or availability.\r\n\r\nWe offer and specialize in ether deep tissue massage or reflexology.\r\n\r\nBody wraps and slimming treatments:\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nBridal makeup\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nBody waxing:\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<div id=\"I11\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I11_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"> Hair extentions</h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\">  Our business values quality over quantity and this is every different aspects of the services that we provide. That\'s why we work with a certified hair stylist that has recivied a doploma from a hight rated school in Toronto.</h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"></h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"></h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\">Here is a little about our stylist Christina: She is a highly certified hair extension technichian working in both Toronto and Durham Region, and specialised in Tape-in, Fusion and microbead methods of extensions. You can either supply your own hair on invest in GBB hair, Grade 7a+hair. Top rated 100% human Remi Hair extensions, used by Toronto Celebrity Extensionists.</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I11\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I11_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<div id=\"rpd\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none burj\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"messages\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none burj\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"hqp-bottom\" class=\"a-section burj\"></div>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-style: italic; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n<strong>\r\n<span style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"> </span>\r\n</strong>\r\n</span>\r\n</span></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I214\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I214_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Courier New\', monospace;\">Cash Transactions Only !</span>\r\n</span></h2>\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I175\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 15px 15px 15px 15px;\">\r\n<div id=\"I175_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\'; font-size: small;\"><b>(</b></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I146\" class=\"Panel_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px;\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"I88\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: center;\"><img id=\"I88_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_parties.gif\" /></div>\r\n<div id=\"I89\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I89_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">Sunless Tanning and Spa provides Wedding and Tan Parties!</span></h4>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: large;\">Large\r\ndiscounts are given to groups. Examples include pre-prom, divorce\r\nparties, bachelorette parties, girls night in, birthday parties, and\r\nmuch more!!</span></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\">** Brides must schedule a trial tan prior to wedding.</span></em></span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Services', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '8-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-11-06 08:34:31', '2017-11-06 08:34:31', '', 8, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/8-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(92, 2, '2017-11-06 08:34:45', '2017-11-06 08:34:45', '&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\">Here is a little about our stylist Christina: She is a highly certified hair extension technichian working in both Toronto and Durham Region, and specialised in Tape-in, Fusion and microbead methods of extensions. You can either supply your own hair on invest in GBB hair, Grade 7a+hair. Top rated 100% human Remi Hair extensions, used by Toronto Celebrity Extensionists.</h3>', 'Our team', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '87-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-11-06 08:34:45', '2017-11-06 08:34:45', '', 87, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/87-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(240, 2, '2018-01-02 15:12:51', '2018-01-02 15:12:51', '<div id=\"I52\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\">\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"wp-image-201 aligncenter\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/no-300x146.jpg\" alt=\"no\" width=\"655\" height=\"319\" />\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I44\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I44_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h5 style=\"color: #330000; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\">We are now aware of the sun’s harmful effects and damage to our skin. As a result,, more and more people are opting for UV free sunless tanning. In under 20 minutes you can have a safe and beautiful tan, achieving the same results as countless days in the sun, without the aging\r\neffects.  </span></span></h5>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"I42\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><strong>How is your tan achieved?</strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"I45\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I45_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">This tan is achieved throught a  technician who will spray DHA tanning formula onto your body. </span>The <span style=\"font-size: small;\">FDA approved dihydroxyaceton (DHA) reacts with the amino acids in the</span><span style=\"font-size: small;\">outermost layer of the skin. When DHA is combined with the amino acids in </span>your skin, it reacts by giving your skin a tan appearance. <span style=\"font-size: small;\">If you are pregnant, please </span><span style=\"font-size: small;\">have your physician approve.</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I49\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I49_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000;\"><strong>What is the solution that you use?</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: small;\">The solution used during your session is customized and based on your skin tone and  your desired color intensity. In addition, our solutions contain a bronzer, a temporary coloring agent, which washes off leaving behind your sunless tan. It takes approximately 3 to 24hours after the session for the solution to fully tan your skin, depending of the solution you choose. </span><span style=\"font-size: small;\">\r\n</span></p>\r\nThe tan lasts between 7-10 days, but it really depends on your skin type and how well you moisturize after. However,this can be extended by using a tan extender containing DHA, which will prolong the tan. Tan extenders are available for purchase at the time of your appointment.\r\n\r\nChoose between:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Premium Norvel, One hour rapid tan, Norvel Venetian(exotic color) , Blackout competition((bodybuilding) and Norvel Organic.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I56\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><strong>Pre and Post care directives for spray tans</strong></div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><strong> </strong></div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">It </span>is best to lightly exfoliate your skin and shave prior to the <span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">appointment. Use a nongreasy scrub like DermaDoctor KP Duty Body Scrub. </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">This promotes even coverage and lengthens the duration of your tan by </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">removing dead skin that would otherwise flake off. </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">Do not wear makeup, moisturizer, deodorant, lotions, etc. which can act as </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">a barrier to the spray and stops the process from working properly. While not necessary, wearing flip flops and dark, loose fitting clothing and undergarments to your appointment is helpful.  </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">If your appointment is on location, a tan pop up tent will be available of you  desire not to tan in a walk-in shower (the best option for light).</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">You </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">can choose to be dressed (or not)~ most clients wear a bathing suit, </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">but disposable bottoms are provided if desired. A disposable hair cap </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">will also be provided. The topical bronzer may rub off on clothing but </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">it will wash out of most fabrics.</span></div>\r\n<div id=\"I8\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I8_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">**String bikinis are not recommended because they can leave uneven lines...\r\n</span></p>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-198\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless27-300x281.jpg\" alt=\"sunless27\" width=\"300\" height=\"281\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-199\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless25-277x300.jpg\" alt=\"sunless25\" width=\"277\" height=\"300\" />\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I53\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\">Wait at least 8 hours before showering, exercising( for best results), or using a pool. (don’t get caught in the rain after!!) Most importantly, moisturize morning and evening on a daily basis after your first shower. Avoid Dove soap and moisturizers containing AHA (Alpha Hydroxy Acid), retinols, and lactic acid. Also avoid exfoliating and long hot showers and baths~ excessive cleansing can dull the affects. Chlorine in pools and hot tubs can decrease the longevity of your tan too.</div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-205 alignright\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/tani.jpg\" alt=\"tani\" width=\"236\" height=\"227\" />For best results, use a tan extender with DHA, which is available for purchase at the time of your appointment.</div>\r\n<div id=\"I162\" class=\"Panel_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px;\"></div>', 'FAQ', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '14-revision-v1', '', '', '2018-01-02 15:12:51', '2018-01-02 15:12:51', '', 14, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/?p=240', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(94, 2, '2017-11-09 20:49:25', '2017-11-09 20:49:25', '&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nOur CEO Jan B:  Currently based in Toronto had the chance to live and visit Miami since she is 21 years old. She has always loved the Miami glow and this is what she wants to bring to everyone in Toronto. Jan believes that the most important in the beauty business is the quality of the service provided. She has received a specific training from the best spray tan proffessionals in Canada. She is specialised in body contouring\r\n\r\nur hair stylist christina P:\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\">Here is a little about our stylist Chris: She is a highly certified hair extension technichian working in both Toronto and Durham Region, and specialised in Tape-in, Fusion and microbead methods of extensions. You can either supply your own hair on invest in GBB hair, Grade 7a+hair. Top rated 100% human Remi Hair extensions, used by Toronto Celebrity Extensionists. ;l</h3>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nOur medical estestichian Khalid M.      Khalid is an award winning Medical Aesthetician and a proffesional Makeup artist. He graduated with from Marca College with distinction and  the most prestigious Dermalogica student of the Year award. He offers all medical esthetics services including facials, Swedish and Lymphatic drainage massages, full body waxing, body wrap and slimming treatment and finally, party and bridal makeup services. All of these services can be done in the confort of your own home without any need to travel to a specific location.', 'Our team', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '87-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-11-09 20:49:25', '2017-11-09 20:49:25', '', 87, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/87-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(95, 2, '2017-11-09 21:09:34', '2017-11-09 21:09:34', 'All the members of our team are more than welcome to offer all the services available in the confort of your own home, at very affordable prices and with the best quality guarantee.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Our CEO Jan B: </strong>\r\n\r\nCurrently based in Toronto, Jan had the chance to live and visit Miami since she is 21 years old. She has always loved the Miami glow and this is what she wants to bring to everyone in Toronto. Jan believes that the most important in the beauty business is the quality of the service provided. She has received a specific training from the best spray tan proffessionals in Canada. She is specialized in body contouring(a technique that allows you to enchance a specific part of your body like create more definition on your  abs, your chest, your arms....), she also have fallowed a course with certification that allow her to practice body massages, full body waxing and body wraps treatments.\r\n\r\n<strong> Our hair stylist christina P:</strong>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\">Here is a little about our stylist Chris: She is a highly certified hair extension technichian working in both Toronto and Durham Region, and specialised in Tape-in, Fusion and microbead methods of extensions. You can either supply your own hair on invest in GBB hair, Grade 7a+hair. Top rated 100% human Remi Hair extensions, used by Toronto Celebrity Extensionists. Chris is also a cut and color technichian dipplomed from Fiorio Academy in Toronto.</h3>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Our medical estestichian Khalid M:</strong>\r\n\r\nKhalid is an award winning Medical Aesthetician and a proffesional Makeup artist. He graduated with from Marca College with distinction and  the most prestigious Dermalogica student of the Year award. He offers all medical esthetics services including facials, Swedish and Lymphatic drainage massages, full body waxing, body wrap and slimming trea