cally curly hair, but it\'s more often used for restoration of damaged hair. The amazing results will leave hair elastic, flexible, and soft, with a naturally vibrant shine.\r\n\r\nWe also offer an other formula without formaldehyde. Formeldehyde could be harmful in a long term use according to some studies but only if the vapor is inhaled. It\'s at your discretion to choose which product you want to use, but we will always be there to advise you and respond to your questions.\r\n<h1 id=\"title\" class=\"a-size-large a-spacing-none\"></h1>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h1 id=\"title\" class=\"a-size-large a-spacing-none\"></h1>\r\n<strong>Massage therapy  </strong>\r\n\r\nRelax, we will come to you!\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nWe bring quality Massage Therapy in your home, office or hotel.  We invite you to enjoy a unique mobile massage therapy experience in the comfort and privacy of your home, hotel,office...This is a perfect way to relax your mind, body, and spirit without having to coordinate location or availability.\r\n\r\nWe offer and specialize in ether  swedish, lymphatic drainage, deep tissue massage or reflexology.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Body wraps and slimming treatments:</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>A toning body wrap, and detoxifying wrap complements any weight loss program. The herbs in the body wrap solution have detoxying properties and help the body eliminate acidic waste. The warm body wrap treatment helps in the absorption of the solution\'s ingredients so that they can begin to detoxify the body, help burn fat, and firm and tone the skin. It is a nice non invasive cellulite treatment.</strong>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nAfter care:\r\n\r\nDrink 6 - 8 glasses of water a day - for three days to help the body flush out toxins.\r\n\r\nDo not shower for 12 hours after the body wrap. Leave the solution on your skin. That\'s it. The inch loss results are fabulous\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Bridal makeup</strong>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"_Tgc\">Even though <b>wedding makeup</b> is usually very simple and neutral, it\'s one of the hardest <b>makeup</b> looks to create, since it has to be PERFECT. ... You\'ll probably want to get your mascara waterproof, lips to be kiss proof, and your skin <b>makeup</b> to be like porcelaine.\r\n</span>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Body waxing:\r\n</strong>\r\n\r\n<b>   It\'s</b> a form of semi-permanent hair removal which removes the hair from the root. New hair will not grow back in the previously waxed area for four to six weeks, although some people will start to see regrowth in only 2 weeks due to some of their hair being on a different <a title=\"Human hair growth\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Human_hair_growth\">human hair growth</a> cycle. Almost any area of the body can be waxed, it\'s an easy, fast and very convinent precedure.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<div id=\"I11\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I11_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"> Hair extentions and</h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\">  Our business values quality over quantity and this is every different aspects of the services that we provide. That\'s why we work with a certified hair stylist that has recivied a doploma from a hight rated school in Toronto.</h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"></h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"></h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I11\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I11_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<div id=\"rpd\" class=\"a-section a-spacin