(108, 2, '2017-11-15 20:13:10', '2017-11-15 20:13:10', '<ul>\r\n 	<li id=\"I31\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><img id=\"I31_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/discover.gif\" alt=\"Discover a new level of sunless tanning\" /></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div id=\"I30\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0 0 0 0;\">\r\n<div id=\"I30_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\r\n</span>Mobile spray tan, spa services, and hair extensions all at once in the comfort of your own home! </span></h2>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"> Feel the <strong><em>Miami glow,</em></strong> even during the Canadian winter!<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; color: #330000;\">\r\n</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; color: #330000;\">Miami Touch Tanning and Spa is the premier mobile airbrush tanning, spa services and hair extensions services all combined  in Toronto, ON.  Recognized as the best in the area, we provide customized solutions to our clients, who include celebrities, bodybuilders, moms, and others looking for a natural looking long lasting tan. We are also very proud to offer you many other services related to beauty. You can choose between an infratherapy session, a therapeutic massage, body waxing, facials,  keratin hair treatment, some teeth whitening, or even a set of new hair extensions. You can also combine multiple treatment at the same time to your convenience.\r\n</span>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\">Mobile Services</span>\r\n</b>\r\n</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">Customized solutions</span></span></span></b></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">    </span>\r\n</span>\r\n</span>Norvel products( spray tan)  </b></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b>                                                                                                          </b></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b>1) Premium Norvel: This bronzer does not have an immediate visible effect but begin to react with the skin after application. This solution does not contain consmetic bronzers, but only DHA which react with the amino acids in your skin to create the darkening reaction of tan.</b>   </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">                      </span><b>\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">2) 1 hour rapid tan:  Designed for all skin tones, clients can      rinse within 1hour for light bronze, 2 hours for medium bronze and 3 hours for darkest bronze. Color will continue to develope for 24 hours