\">surrounding</span> areas.</span></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I120\" class=\"Horizontal_Line_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px;\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"I2\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0px;\">\r\n<div id=\"I2_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000;\"><span style=\"color: #330022; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nAirbrush tanning is one of the safest and healthiest way of achieving a beautiful tan......\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">\r\nAfter testing dozens of solutions from all over the world, we discovered the finest solution that will give you a natural, instant tan (in 10 minutes!) and will last up to ten days. You can depend on us for that bronzed, healthy look when time is of the essence and perfection is required. Sunless Tanning and Spa</span> <span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">provides professional, personalized service right to your front door. Upon request, we bring a pop up tent so there is no mess. There is no waiting and no uncomfortable settings. Our service is safe and is done in the privacy of whatever location you choose: home, office, hotel, or at special events.</span>\r\n</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000;\">We also work with a color-cut and hair extensions specialist for all your hair mobile services. Furthermore, a winning award medical Aestetichian will provide you the best mobile spa services in the GTA , all along with our CEO that also has some specific trainings in spray tans, infratherapy, theet whitening, keratin treatment, massage therapy and body wraps.</p>', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-11-15 22:05:38', '2017-11-15 22:05:38', '', 6, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/6-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(114, 2, '2017-11-15 22:07:31', '2017-11-15 22:07:31', 'All the members of our team are more than welcome to offer all the services available in the comfort of your own home, at very affordable prices and with the best quality guarantee.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Our CEO Jan B: </strong>\r\n\r\nCurrently based in Toronto, Jan had the chance to live and visit Miami since she is 21 years old. She has always loved the Miami glow and this is what she wants to bring to everyone in Toronto. Jan believes that the most important in the beauty business is the quality of the service provided. She has received a specific training from the best spray tan proffessionals in Canada. She is specialized in body contouring(a technique that allows you to enchance a specific part of your body like create more definition on your  abs, your chest, your arms....), she also have fallowed a course with certification that allow her to practice body massages, full body waxing and body wraps treatments.\r\n\r\n<strong> Our hair stylist christina P:</strong>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\">Here is a little about our stylist Chris: She is a highly certified hair extension technichian working in both Toronto and Durham Region, and specialised in Tape-in, Fusion and microbead methods of extensions. You can either supply your own hair on invest in GBB hair, Grade 7a+hair. Top rated 100% human Remi Hair extensions, used by Toronto Celebrity Extensionists. Chris is also a cut and color technichian dipplomed from Fiorio Academy in Toronto.</h3>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Our medical estestichian Khalid M:</strong>\r\n\r\nKhalid is an award winning Medical Aesthetician and a proffesional Makeup artist. He graduated with from Marca College with distinction and  the most prestigious Dermalogica student of the Year award. He offers all medical esthetics services including facials, Swedish and Lymphatic drainage massages, full body waxing, body wrap and slimming treatment and finally, party and bridal makeup services. All of these services can be done in the confort of your own home without any need to travel to a specific location.', 'Our team and testemonials', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '87-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-11-15 22:07:31', '2017-11-15 22:07:31', '', 87, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/87-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
