ext-align: center;\">Maria. L</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans; text-align: center;\">-------</p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans; text-align: center;\">Their hair stylist Chriss is awsome! She will take all the time needed to find the perfect color of hair extensions to match your hair and will also, if needed, color and cut your hair for an amazing match!</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans; text-align: center;\">Antonela .P</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans; text-align: center;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">InStyle Magazine</span></u></span></span></span></span>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">                 </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">  </span></span></span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #330000;\">\" A certified spray tan technician can be in and out the door in 30 minutes, or she\'ll even bring\r\nan extra-special delivery: yummy margaritas and fajitas for a bronzing\r\nbash with your friends.\"</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans; text-align: center;\"></p>', 'Our 