ic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Top Spray tanners in Ontario</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"w\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\"When\r\nshe arrived at our house..she worked quickly...her formula created\r\na believable bronze that lasted for nine days and a feeling that we\r\ncould get used to this kind of service.\" It\'s a total Vip kind of service in the tan industry.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p>', 'Our team and testemonials', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '87-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-11-20 20:54:15', '2017-11-20 20:54:15', '', 87, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/87-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
