(170, 2, '2017-11-21 15:37:19', '2017-11-21 15:37:19', '<div id=\"I30\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0 0 0 0;\">\r\n<div id=\"I30_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-167\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless17-271x300.jpg\" alt=\"sunless17\" width=\"196\" height=\"217\" /><img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-168\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless16-278x300.jpg\" alt=\"sunless16\" width=\"202\" height=\"218\" /><img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-169\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless15-279x300.jpg\" alt=\"sunless15\" width=\"203\" height=\"219\" />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\r\n</span>Mobile spray tan, spa services, and hair extensions all at once in the comfort of your own home! </span></h2>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"> Feel the <strong><em>Miami glow,</em></strong> even during the Canadian winter!<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; color: #330000;\">\r\n</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; color: #330000;\"><strong>Miami Touch Tanning and Spa</strong> is the premier mobile airbrush tanning, spa services and hair extensions services all combined  in Toronto, ON.  Recognized as the best in the area, we provide customized solutions to our clients, who include celebrities, bodybuilders, moms, and others looking for a natural looking long lasting tan. We are also very proud to offer you many other services related to beauty. You can choose between an infratherapy session, a therapeutic massage, body waxing, facials,  keratin hair treatment, some teeth whitening, or even a set of new hair extensions. You can also combine multiple treatment at the same time to your convenience.\r\n</span>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\">Mobile Services</span>\r\n</b>\r\n</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">Customized solutions</span></span></span></b></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">    </span>\r\n</span>\r\n</span>Norvel products( spray tan)  </b></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b>                                                                                                          </b></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b>1) Premium Norvel: This bronzer does not have an immediate visible effect but begin to react with the skin after application. This solution does not contain consmetic bronzers, but only DHA which react with the amino acids in your skin to create the darkening reaction of tan.</b>   </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">                      </span><b>\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">2) 1 hour rapid tan:  Designed for all skin tones, clients can      rinse within 1hour for light bronze, 2 hours for medium bronze and 3 hours for darkest bronze. Color will continue to develope for 24 hours.                               </span></b>\r\n\r\n<b><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">     3) Venetian,  just off the beach mediterranean  color: If you     desire an exotic look, this is the perfect choice for you. This color works with all skin colors, to acheive a darker, deeper, and exotic tan.</span></b>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<strong>4) Competition black out: Our company understands that athletes are professionals investing many years in preparation to compete, and this is way we have decided to use this formula that is highly recommended by winning bodybuilders in the industry: No orange color, raspberry almond frangrance and a deep dark tan for the first place. You can also add some body contouring to you tan and accent any muscle of your body.\r\n</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>5) Norvel organic:  If you are an adept of organic products, this is the right one for you. This formula contains certified organic aloe and is formuled with time release moisturization and specific antioxidants.  Paraben free, Gluten free , Sulfate free( like all the other Norvel products) but also 100% Vegan and with a fragrance from Natural Extracts.\r\n</strong>\r\n<div id=\"I30_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><b><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"> <span style=\"color: #330022;\">Group discounts------ see or prices page</span>\r\n</span>\r\n</b><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">\r\n<b>\r\n<span style=\"color: #330022;\">100%Satisfaction Guaranteed</span>\r\n</b>\r\n</span><b>\r\n<span style=\"color: #330022; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">Service Areas: Greater Toronto Area and <span style=\"line-height: 30px;\">surrounding</span> areas.</span></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I120\" class=\"Horizontal_Line_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px;\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"I2\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0px;\">\r\n<div id=\"I2_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000;\"><span style=\"color: #330022; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large; font-weight: bold;\">\r\nAirbrush tanning is one of the safest and healthiest way of achieving a beautiful tan......\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">\r\nAfter testing dozens of solutions from all over the world, we discovered the finest solution that will give you a natural, instant tan (in 10 minutes!) and will last up to ten days. You can depend on us for that bronzed, healthy look when time is of the essence and perfection is required. Sunless Tanning and Spa</span> <span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">provides professional, personalized service right to your front door. Upon request, we bring a pop up tent so there is no mess. There is no waiting and no uncomfortable settings. Our service is safe and is done in the privacy of whatever location you choose: home, office, hotel, or at special events.</span>\r\n</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000;\">We also work with a color-cut and hair extensions specialist for all your hair mobile services. Furthermore, a winning award medical Aestetichian will provide you the best mobile spa services in the GTA , all along with our CEO that also has some specific trainings in spray tans, infratherapy, theet whitening, keratin treatment, massage therapy and body wraps.</p>', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-11-21 15:37:19', '2017-11-21 15:37:19', '', 6, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/6-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
