(178, 2, '2017-11-21 16:56:07', '2017-11-21 16:56:07', '<strong><span style=\"color: #993366;\"><em>All the members of our team are more than welcome to offer all the services available in the comfort of your own home, at very affordable prices and with the best quality guarantee.</em></span></strong>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Our CEO Jan B: </strong>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nCurrently based in Toronto, Jan had the chance to live and visit Miami since she is 21 years old. She has always loved the Miami glow and this is what she wants to bring to everyone in Toronto. Jan believes that the most important in the beauty business is the quality of the service provided. She has received a specific training from the best spray tan proffesionals in Canada. She is specialized in body contouring(a technique that allows you to enchance a specific part of your body like create more definition on your  abs, your chest, your arms....), she also have fallowed a course with certification that allow her to practice body massages, full body waxing and body wraps treatments.\r\n\r\n<strong> Our hair stylist Christina P:\r\n</strong>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"size-medium wp-image-176 alignleft\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/sunless20-220x300.jpg\" alt=\"sunless20\" width=\"220\" height=\"300\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nHere is a little about our hair stylist Chriss: She is a Highly Certified hair extensions Technician, Hairstylist and Color Technicia, having attended the prestigious FIORIO Hair Academy in Toronto. Christina is working in both Toronto and Durham Region, and specialised in Tape-in, Fusion and microbead methods of extensions. You can either supply your own hair on invest in GBB hair, Grade 7a+hair. Top rated 100% human Remi Hair extensions, used by Toronto Celebretry Extensionists. She specializes in balayage, color melts and ombre.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Our medical estestichian Khalid M:</strong>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"size-medium wp-image-177 alignleft\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/sunless24-169x300.png\" alt=\"sunless24\" width=\"169\" height=\"300\" />\r\n\r\nKhalid is an award winning Medical Aesthetician and a proffesional Makeup artist. He graduated with from Marca College with distinction and  the most prestigious Dermalogica student of the Year award. He offers all medical esthetics services including facials, Swedish and Lymphatic drainage massages, full body waxing, body wrap and slimming treatment and finally, party and bridal makeup services. All of these services can be done in the confort of your own home without any need to travel to a specific location.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Testemonials</strong>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<p class=\"w\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">March 2017</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #332200; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: medium;\">The Best of the Best: Miami touch sunless </span><span style=\"color: #332200; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: medium;\">Tanning spa</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #332200; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: medium;\">\"Her at-home airbrushing leaves skin glowing\". All combined with some infratherapy, it\'s like the perfect combo for anyone that want to look fresh all year round. Plus, packages are available.</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">--------</div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<div id=\"I80\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0px 0px 0px 10px;\">\r\n<div id=\"I80_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\">\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans; text-align: center;\">Khalid is a rare pearl, his hands are magic and this was the best lymphatic draining massage i ever had. He took his time and i ve never felt rushed or anything. I also bought a package of body wraps witch also were beyond my expectetions.</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans; text-align: center;\">Maria. L</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans; text-align: center;\">-------</p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans; text-align: center;\">Their hair stylist Chriss is awsome! She will take all the time needed to find the perfect color of hair extensions to match your hair and will also, if needed, color and cut your hair for an amazing match!</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans; text-align: center;\">Antonela .P</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">InStyle Magazine</span></u></span></span></span></span>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">                 </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">  </span></span></span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #330000;\">\" A certified spray tan technician can be in and out the door in 30 minutes, or she\'ll even bring\r\nan extra-special delivery: yummy margaritas and fajitas for a bronzing\r\nbash with your friends.\"</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p class=\"w\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Top Spray tanners in Ontario</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"w\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\"When\r\nshe arrived at our house..she worked quickly...her formula created\r\na believable bronze that lasted for nine days and a feeling that we\r\ncould get used to this kind of service.\" It\'s a total Vip kind of service in the tan industry.</span></span></span></p>', 'Our team and testemonials', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '87-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-11-21 16:56:07', '2017-11-21 16:56:07', '', 87, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/87-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
