(202, 2, '2017-11-21 17:46:30', '2017-11-21 17:46:30', '<div id=\"I52\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\">\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"wp-image-201 aligncenter\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/no-300x146.jpg\" alt=\"no\" width=\"655\" height=\"319\" />\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I44\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I44_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h5 style=\"color: #330000; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\">We are now aware of the sun’s harmful effects and damage to our skin. As a result,, more and more people are opting for UV free sunless tanning. In under 20 minutes you can have a safe and beautiful tan, achieving the same results as countless days in the sun, without the aging\r\neffects.  </span></span></h5>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"I42\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><strong>How is your tan achieved?</strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"I45\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I45_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">This tan is achieved throught a  technician who will spray DHA tanning formula onto your body. </span>The <span style=\"font-size: small;\">FDA approved dihydroxyaceton (DHA) reacts with the amino acids in the</span><span style=\"font-size: small;\">outermost layer of the skin. When DHA is combined with the amino acids in </span>your skin, it reacts by giving your skin a tan appearance. <span style=\"font-size: small;\">If you are pregnant, please </span><span style=\"font-size: small;\">have your physician approve.</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I49\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I49_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000;\"><strong>What is the solution that you use?</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: small;\">The solution used during your session is customized and based on your skin tone and  your desired color intensity. In addition, our solutions contain a bronzer, a temporary coloring agent, which washes off leaving behind your sunless tan. It takes approximately 3 to 24hours after the session for the solution to fully tan your skin, depending of the solution you choose. </span><span style=\"font-size: small;\">\r\n</span></p>\r\nThe tan lasts between 7-10 days, but it really depends on your skin type and how well you moisturize after. However,this can be extended by using a tan extender containing DHA, which will prolong the tan. Tan extenders are available for purchase at the time of your appointment.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I48\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I48_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I56\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><strong>Pre and Post care directives for spray tans</strong></div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><strong> </strong></div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">It </span>is best to lightly exfoliate your skin and shave prior to the <span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">appointment. Use a nongreasy scrub like DermaDoctor KP Duty Body Scrub. </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">This promotes even coverage and lengthens the duration of your tan by </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">removing dead skin that would otherwise flake off. </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">Do not wear makeup, moisturizer, deodorant, lotions, etc. which can act as </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">a barrier to the spray and stops the process from working properly. While not necessary, wearing flip flops and dark, loose fitting clothing and undergarments to your appointment is helpful.  </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">If your appointment is on location, a tan pop up tent will be available of you  desire not to tan in a walk-in shower (the best option for light).</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">You </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">can choose to be dressed (or not)~ most clients wear a bathing suit, </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">but disposable bottoms are provided if desired. A disposable hair cap </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">will also be provided. The topical bronzer may rub off on clothing but </span><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">it will wash out of most fabrics.</span></div>\r\n<div id=\"I8\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I8_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\">**String bikinis are not recommended because they can leave uneven lines...\r\n</span></p>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-198\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless27-300x281.jpg\" alt=\"sunless27\" width=\"300\" height=\"281\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-199\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless25-277x300.jpg\" alt=\"sunless25\" width=\"277\" height=\"300\" />\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I53\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\">Wait at least 8 hours before showering, exercising( for best results), or using a pool. (don’t get caught in the rain after!!) Most importantly, moisturize morning and evening on a daily basis after your first shower. Avoid Dove soap and moisturizers containing AHA (Alpha Hydroxy Acid), retinols, and lactic acid. Also avoid exfoliating and long hot showers and baths~ excessive cleansing can dull the affects. Chlorine in pools and hot tubs can decrease the longevity of your tan too.</div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\">For best results, use a tan extender with DHA, which is available for purchase at the time of your appointment.</div>\r\n<div id=\"I162\" class=\"Panel_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px;\"></div>', 'FAQ', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '14-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-11-21 17:46:30', '2017-11-21 17:46:30', '', 14, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/14-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(203, 2, '2017-11-21 17:48:28', '2017-11-21 17:48:28', '', 'flawless', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'flawless', '', '', '2017-11-21 17:48:28', '2017-11-21 17:48:28', '', 6, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/flawless.jpg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(204, 2, '2017-11-21 17:50:13', '2017-11-21 17:50:13', '<div id=\"I30\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0 0 0 0;\">\r\n<div id=\"I30_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">  <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-167\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless17-271x300.jpg\" alt=\"sunless17\" width=\"225\" height=\"249\" /><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-168\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless16-278x300.jpg\" alt=\"sunless16\" width=\"231\" height=\"249\" /><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-169\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless15-279x300.jpg\" alt=\"sunless15\" width=\"231\" height=\"248\" />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">Mobile spray tan, spa services, and hair extensions all at once in the comfort of your own home!</span> </span></h2>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"> Feel the <strong><em><span style=\"color: #ffff00;\">Miami glow</span>,</em></strong> even during the Canadian winter!<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; color: #330000;\">\r\n</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; color: #330000;\"><strong>Miami Touch Tanning and Spa</strong> is the premier mobile airbrush tanning, spa services and hair extensions services all combined  in Toronto, ON.  Recognized as the best in the area, we provide customized solutions to our clients, who include celebrities, bodybuilders, moms, and others looking for a natural looking long lasting tan. We are also very proud to offer you many other services related to beauty. You can choose between an infratherapy session, a therapeutic massage, body waxing, facials,  keratin hair treatment, some teeth whitening, or even a set of new hair extensions. You can also combine multiple treatment at the same time to your convenience.\r\n</span>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\">Mobile Services</span>\r\n</b>\r\n</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">  Customized solutions</span></span></span></b></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">    </span>\r\n</span>\r\n</span><span style=\"color: #333399;\"><em>Norvel products( spray tan)</em></span></b></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-173\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless2-300x115.jpg\" alt=\"sunless2\" width=\"610\" height=\"234\" /></span></b></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b>                                                                                            </b></span>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><b> </b><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b>1) Premium Norvel: This bronzer does not have an immediate visible effect but begin to react with the skin after application. This solution does not contain consmetic bronzers, but only DHA which react with the amino acids in your skin to create the darkening reaction of tan.</b>   </span></li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"> </span><b><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">2) 1 hour rapid tan:  Designed for all skin tones, clients can   rinse within 1hour for light bronze, 2 hours for medium bronze and 3 hours for darkest bronze. Color will continue to develope for 24 hours.                               </span></b></li>\r\n 	<li><b><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"> 3) Venetian,  just off the beach mediterranean  color: If you     desire an exotic look, this is the perfect choice for you. This color works with all skin colors, to acheive a darker, deeper, and exotic tan.</span></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>4) Competition black out: Our company understands that athletes are professionals investing many years in preparation to compete, and this is way we have decided to use this formula that is highly recommended by winning bodybuilders in the industry: No orange color, raspberry almond frangrance and a deep dark tan for the first place. You can also add some body contouring to you tan and accent any muscle of your body.\r\n</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>5) Norvel organic:  If you are an adept of organic products, this is the right one for you. This formula contains certified organic aloe and is formuled with time release moisturization and specific antioxidants.  Paraben free, Gluten free , Sulfate free( like all the other Norvel products) but also 100% Vegan and with a fragrance from Natural Extracts.\r\n</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div id=\"I30_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><b><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"> <span style=\"color: #330022;\">Group discounts------ see or prices page</span>\r\n</span>\r\n</b><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-203 alignnone\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/flawless.jpg\" alt=\"flawless\" width=\"236\" height=\"236\" />\r\n<b>\r\n<span style=\"color: #330022;\">100%Satisfaction Guaranteed</span>\r\n</b>\r\n</span><b>\r\n<span style=\"color: #330022; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">Service Areas: Greater Toronto Area and <span style=\"line-height: 30px;\">surrounding</span> areas.</span></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I120\" class=\"Horizontal_Line_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px;\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"I2\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0px;\">\r\n<div id=\"I2_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000;\"><span style=\"color: #330022; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large; font-weight: bold;\">\r\n<span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">Airbrush tanning is one of the safest and healthiest way of achieving a beautiful tan......</span>\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">\r\nAfter testing dozens of solutions from all over the world, we discovered the finest solution that will give you a natural, instant tan (in 10 minutes!) and will last up to ten days. You can depend on us for that bronzed, healthy look when time is of the essence and perfection is required. Sunless Tanning and Spa</span> <span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">provides professional, personalized service right to your front door. Upon request, we bring a pop up tent so there is no mess. There is no waiting and no uncomfortable settings. Our service is safe and is done in the privacy of whatever location you choose: home, office, hotel, or at special events. </span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">We also work with a color-cut and hair extensions specialist for all your hair mobile services. Furthermore, a winning medical Aestetichian will provide you the best mobile Spa services in the GTA. All along with our CE0, that also has some some specific trainings in spray tanning, infratherapy, theet whitening, keratin hair treatment, massage therapy and body wraps.\r\n</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-11-21 17:50:13', '2017-11-21 17:50:13', '', 6, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/6-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
