/p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">*For body contouring(abs, arms...) Add 10 per area.</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"I138\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I138_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"> </span></h5>\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">All Other GTA areas fees may apply</span></h5>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I140\" class=\"Horizontal_Line_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px;\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"I139\" class=\"Layout1_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<table style=\"width: 814px; height: 900px;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td id=\"Left_I139\" style=\"text-align: left; vertical-align: top; width: 50%; padding: 0;\">\r\n<div id=\"I141\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I141_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-style: italic; text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"line-height: 24px;\">Infratherapy: </span></span></h5>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">single session: 45$</div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">5 session package: 199$</div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">*add 8$ per treatment for the app