(222, 2, '2017-11-21 18:45:16', '2017-11-21 18:45:16', '<div id=\"I33\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: left;\"><img id=\"I33_img\" style=\"width: 604px; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_services.gif\" alt=\"Now offering the Express Tan\" />( color develops within one haour)</div>\r\n<div id=\"I11\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I11_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h2></h2>\r\n<h2 style=\"letter-spacing: normal;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><strong>\r\n</strong>\r\n</span></h2>\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">\r\n<strong>\r\n<span style=\"font-size: xx-large;\"><span style=\"line-height: 48px;\">Sunless tanning</span></span>\r\n</strong>\r\n</span></h2>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">\r\nFirst of all, a special pre-tan moisturizer is applied to dry areas of the body .  Then, using a customized solution based on your skin tone and desired shade of color, the solution is applied to your full body via an HVLP gun. Finally, You are finished off with a special powder so there is no \"sticky\" feeling like most spray tans.....\r\n</span>\r\n</span></h3>\r\n</div>\r\nA different lotion will be applied depending of the level of darkness that you want to achieve. It\'s very important never to forget that each individual is different and that one product that gives you very good results may not be the best for someone else.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>DHA products </strong>~</span></span>\r\n<div id=\"I11\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I11_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size: medium;\"> Post tan care is one of the most important factor on how your spray tan application will last. A minimal investment in the good aftercare will save you money in long term. However, never start to moiziture until after your  first shower. Norvel sunless color extender PROLONG is the product that i recommend to everyone that wants to keep a flawless and long lasting tan.</span></span></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none fbHeader\"><span id=\"aboutTheProductText\" class=\"a-size-medium\">About the product</span></div>\r\n<div id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section collapsedFeatureBullets showAllFeatureBullets\">\r\n<div id=\"fbExpandableSection\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\">\r\n<div id=\"fbExpandableSectionContent\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\">\r\n<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\">\r\n 	<li class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Build and extend your sunless tan</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Time release micro capsules</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Advanced DHA odor encapsulation</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Use Daily</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"showHiddenFeatureBullets\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">Paraben Free, Gluten Free, 100% Vegan</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nSome before and after results:\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-221\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/before-300x292.jpg\" alt=\"before\" width=\"300\" height=\"292\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<div id=\"I11\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I11_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Infratherapy</strong> </span></h3>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"wp-image-184 alignright\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless3-300x231.jpg\" alt=\"sunless3\" width=\"321\" height=\"247\" />\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\nWhat is it?\r\n\r\nHave you ever run 5km without moving your feet? You can burn up to 900 calories per session in the comfort of your home.The totally safe infrared waves penetrate the muscles and cause up to three times higher than in traditional saunas. Your body will be covered in a film of detoxifying organic herbs or in a thermogenic burning cream( depending on your choice) and then enveloped in an infrared covering to eliminate toxins and boost circulation.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nWhat are the benefits of it:\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n-  Body detoxification, eliminate toxins\r\n\r\n-Activate body circulation.\r\n\r\n-Weight loss, anti-cellulite: ideal for thinning down.\r\n\r\nResults are noticeable after 3 to 5 sessions.\r\n\r\nRelieve muscle pain : smooths arthritis, fibromyalgia and rheumatism. For muscle pain, the relief is immediate.\r\n\r\nReduce stress and fatigue.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 21.6px;\">teeth </span>whitening</b></span>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"size-medium wp-image-185 alignleft\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless4-291x300.jpg\" alt=\"sunless4\" width=\"291\" height=\"300\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nThe procedure:  A safe whitening gel is applied to the teeth using a tray, then an LED professional portable light is placed in front of the costumer\'s teeth and runs for 15 to 20 minutes per treatment. It\'s important to know that a real medical LED is used, not the ones that you see for at home use.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"size-medium wp-image-186 aligncenter\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless5-300x250.jpg\" alt=\"sunless5\" width=\"300\" height=\"250\" />\r\n\r\nBenefits:  You will see an imporovment from the first appointment, and it will continue to whiten after each session. It\'s imortant to remember that the product that we use is safe for the dental enamel and won\'t damage it.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Keratin hair treatment: </strong>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-187\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless7-287x300.jpg\" alt=\"sunless7\" width=\"287\" height=\"300\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-189\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless9-277x300.jpg\" alt=\"sunless9\" width=\"277\" height=\"300\" />\r\n\r\nAlso known as the Brazilian keratin treatment, this treatment instantly strengthens, smooths,repairs and condition damaged hair. The products that we use restore split ends, breakage and dryness using moisture rich ingredients. Results usually last between 4 to 7 months. It can also straighten dramatically curly hair, but it\'s more often used for restoration of damaged hair. The amazing results will leave hair elastic, flexible, and soft, with a naturally vibrant shine.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nWe also offer an other formula without formaldehyde. Formeldehyde could be harmful in a long term use according to some studies but only if the <img class=\"size-medium wp-image-188 alignleft\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless8-287x300.jpg\" alt=\"sunless8\" width=\"287\" height=\"300\" />vapor is inhaled. It\'s at your discretion to choose which product you want to use, but we will always be there to advise you and respond to your questions.\r\n<h1 id=\"title\" class=\"a-size-large a-spacing-none\"></h1>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h1 id=\"title\" class=\"a-size-large a-spacing-none\"></h1>\r\n<strong>Massage therapy  </strong>\r\n\r\nRelax, we will come to you!\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"size-medium wp-image-190 alignleft\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless11-184x300.jpg\" alt=\"sunless11\" width=\"184\" height=\"300\" />\r\n\r\nWe bring quality Massage Therapy in your home, office or hotel.  We invite you to enjoy a unique mobile massage therapy experience in the comfort and privacy of your home, hotel,office...This is a perfect way to relax your mind, body, and spirit without having to coordinate location or availability.\r\n\r\nWe offer and specialize in ether  swedish, lymphatic drainage, deep tissue massage or reflexology.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Body wraps and slimming treatments:</strong>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"size-medium wp-image-191 alignright\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless10-284x300.jpg\" alt=\"sunless10\" width=\"284\" height=\"300\" />A toning body wrap, and detoxifying wrap complements any weight loss program. The herbs in the body wrap solution have detoxying properties and help the body eliminate acidic waste. The warm body wrap treatment helps in the absorption of the solution\'s ingredients so that they can begin to detoxify the body, help burn fat, and firm and tone the skin. It is a nice non invasive cellulite treatment.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nAfter care:\r\n\r\nDrink 6 - 8 glasses of water a day - for three days to help the body flush out toxins.\r\n\r\nDo not shower for 12 hours after the body wrap. Leave the solution on your skin. That\'s it. The inch loss results are fabulous\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Bridal makeup</strong>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"_Tgc\"><img class=\"size-medium wp-image-192 alignleft\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless12-275x300.jpg\" alt=\"sunless12\" width=\"275\" height=\"300\" />Even though <b>wedding makeup</b> is usually very simple and neutral, it\'s one of the hardest <b>makeup</b> looks to create, since it has to be PERFECT. ... You\'ll probably want to get your mascara waterproof, lips to be kiss proof, and your skin <b>makeup</b> to be like porcelaine. Our makeup artist Khalid,</span>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Body waxing:\r\n</strong>\r\n\r\n<b>   It\'s</b> a form of semi-permanent hair removal which removes the hair from the root. New hair will not grow back in the previously waxed area for four to six weeks, although some people will start to see regrowth in only 2 weeks due to some of their hair being on a different <a title=\"Human hair growth\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Human_hair_growth\">human hair growth</a> cycle.Almost any area of the body can be waxed, it\'s an easy, fast and very convinent precedure.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<strong>Hair extensions</strong>\r\n\r\nOur business values quality over quantity, and this in every different aspects of the services that we provide. This is way,  we work with a Certified Hair stylist that has a lot of experience with hair extensions. You can consult Christrina biography on the page called \'\'our team\'\'. Here  bellow is some of her work on clients:\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-193\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless21-300x291.jpg\" alt=\"sunless21\" width=\"275\" height=\"267\" />        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-194\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless22-300x292.jpg\" alt=\"sunless22\" width=\"282\" height=\"274\" />\r\n<h6></h6>\r\n<div id=\"I11\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I11_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"><strong> <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-196\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless23-181x300.jpg\" alt=\"sunless23\" width=\"227\" height=\"376\" /></strong></h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000; font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I11\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I11_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<div id=\"rpd\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none burj\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"messages\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none burj\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"hqp-bottom\" class=\"a-section burj\"></div>\r\n<h3 style=\"color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-style: italic; font-weight: normal;\">\r\n<strong>\r\n<span style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\"> </span>\r\n</strong>\r\n</span>\r\n</span></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I214\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I214_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Courier New\', monospace;\">Cash Transactions Only !</span>\r\n</span></h2>\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I175\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 15px 15px 15px 15px;\">\r\n<div id=\"I175_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, \'Arial Unicode MS\'; font-size: small;\"><b>(</b></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"I146\" class=\"Panel_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px;\"></div>\r\n<div id=\"I88\" class=\"Image_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; text-align: center;\"><img id=\"I88_img\" style=\"; border: none;\" src=\"&lt;?php echo bloginfo(\'stylesheet_directory\'); ?&gt;/img/head_parties.gif\" /></div>\r\n<div id=\"I89\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both;\">\r\n<div id=\"I89_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">Sunless Tanning and Spa provides Wedding and Tan Parties!</span></h4>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: large;\">Large\r\ndiscounts are given to groups. Examples include pre-prom, divorce\r\nparties, bachelorette parties, girls night in, birthday parties, and\r\nmuch more!!</span></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #330000; font-size: small;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: Comic Sans MS,Comic Sans;\">** Brides must schedule a trial tan prior to wedding.</span></em></span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'Services', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '8-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-11-21 18:45:16', '2017-11-21 18:45:16', '', 8, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/8-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
