(243, 2, '2018-01-15 16:13:17', '2018-01-15 16:13:17', '<div id=\"I30\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0 0 0 0;\">\n<div id=\"I30_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n<h2></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">  <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-167\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless17-271x300.jpg\" alt=\"sunless17\" width=\"225\" height=\"249\" /><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-231\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/3339a600-a096-4a9a-8969-22ced7bc356c-300x300.png\" alt=\"3339a600-a096-4a9a-8969-22ced7bc356c\" width=\"249\" height=\"249\" /><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-169\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless15-279x300.jpg\" alt=\"sunless15\" width=\"232\" height=\"249\" /></span></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n</span><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">Mobile spray tan, spa services, and hair extensions all at once in the comfort of your own home</span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">!</span> </span></h2>\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"> Feel the <strong><em><span style=\"color: #ffff00;\">Miami glow</span>,</em></strong> even during the Canadian winter in Toronto!<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; color: #330000;\">\n</span></span></div>\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div style=\"color: #333333; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><strong>Miami Touch Tanning and Spa</strong> is the premier mobile airbrush tanning, spa services and hair extensions services all combined  in Toronto, ON.  Recognized as the best in the area, we provide customized solutions to our clients, who include celebrities, bodybuilders, moms, and others looking for a natural looking long lasting tan. We are also very proud to offer you many other services related to beauty. You can choose between an infratherapy session, a therapeutic massage, body waxing, facials,  keratin hair treatment, some teeth whitening, or even a set of new hair extensions. You can also combine multiple treatment at the same time to your convenience.\n</span></div>\n<ul>\n 	<li><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\">Mobile Services</span>\n</b>\n</span></li>\n 	<li><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">  Customized solutions</span></span></span></b></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">    </span>\n</span>\n</span><span style=\"color: #333399;\"><em>Norvel products( spray tan)</em></span></b></span></li>\n</ul>\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-173\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/sunless2-300x115.jpg\" alt=\"sunless2\" width=\"610\" height=\"234\" /></span></b></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b>                                                                                            </b></span>\n\n<b> <img class=\"alignright wp-image-207\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/nn-128x300.jpg\" alt=\"nn\" width=\"167\" height=\"392\" /></b>\n\n</div>\n<div id=\"I30_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<ul>\n 	<li><b><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"> <span style=\"color: #330022;\">Group discounts------ see or prices page</span>\n</span>\n</b><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">\n</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><img class=\"wp-image-203 alignleft\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/flawless.jpg\" alt=\"flawless\" width=\"213\" height=\"213\" />              <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-225\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/Dallas-Airbrush-Tan_large-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"Dallas-Airbrush-Tan_large\" width=\"301\" height=\"201\" />\n<b>\n</b></span></li>\n 	<li><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\"><b><span style=\"color: #330022;\">100%Satisfaction Guaranteed</span>\n</b>\n</span><b>\n<span style=\"color: #330022; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large;\">Service Areas: Greater Toronto Area and <span style=\"line-height: 30px;\">surrounding</span> areas.</span></b></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"I120\" class=\"Horizontal_Line_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 10px 10px 10px 10px;\"></div>\n<div id=\"I2\" class=\"Text_Default\" style=\"display: block; clear: both; margin: 0px;\">\n<div id=\"I2_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000;\"><span style=\"color: #330022; font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\'; font-size: large; font-weight: bold;\">\n<span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">Airbrush tanning is one of the safest and healthiest way of achieving a beautiful tan......</span>\n</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">\nAfter testing dozens of solutions from all over the world, we discovered the finest solution that will give you a natural, instant tan (in 10 minutes!) and will last up to ten days. You can depend on us for that bronzed, healthy look when time is of the essence and perfection is required. Sunless Tanning and Spa</span> <span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">provides professional, personalized service right to your front door. Upon request, we bring a pop up tent so there is no mess. There is no waiting and no uncomfortable settings. Our service is safe and is done in the privacy of whatever location you choose: home, office, hotel, or at special events. </span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left; color: #330000;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Comic Sans MS\', \'Comic Sans\';\">We also work with a color-cut and hair extensions specialist for all your hair mobile services. Furthermore, a winning medical Aestetichian will provide you the best mobile Spa services in the GTA. All along with our CE0, that also has some some specific trainings in spray tanning, infratherapy, theet whitening, keratin hair treatment, massage therapy and body wraps.\n</span></span></p>\n\n\n[caption id=\"attachment_226\" align=\"alignleft\" width=\"300\"]<img class=\"size-medium wp-image-226\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/index_image_3-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"Couple relaxing during a hot stone therapy at the spa\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" /> Couple relaxing during a hot stone therapy at home[/caption]\n\n<img class=\"size-medium wp-image-227\" src=\"http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/wp-content/uploads/2016/12/bigstock-Girl-Receiving-Cosmetic-Pink-F-16051799-708x531-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"Young beautiful girl receiving pink facial mask in spa beauty salon - indoors\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" />\n\n</div>\n</div>', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6-autosave-v1', '', '', '2018-01-15 16:13:17', '2018-01-15 16:13:17', '', 6, 'http://webmediasolutionz.com/projects/clients/SUNLESS/?p=243', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
