(1325, 2, '2023-05-11 20:20:41', '2023-05-11 20:20:41', '[fusion_builder_container admin_label=\"Increase your conversions\" hundred_percent=\"no\" hundred_percent_height=\"no\" hundred_percent_height_scroll=\"no\" hundred_percent_height_center_content=\"yes\" equal_height_columns=\"no\" hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" background_position=\"center center\" background_repeat=\"no-repeat\" fade=\"no\" background_parallax=\"none\" enable_mobile=\"no\" parallax_speed=\"0.3\" video_aspect_ratio=\"16:9\" video_loop=\"yes\" video_mute=\"yes\" border_style=\"solid\" margin_top=\"0\" margin_bottom=\"0\" padding_top=\"100px\" padding_bottom=\"3%\" admin_toggled=\"yes\" flex_justify_content=\"center\" flex_column_spacing=\"0px\" type=\"flex\"][fusion_builder_row][fusion_builder_column type=\"1_2\" type=\"1_2\" layout=\"1_2\" center_content=\"no\" target=\"_self\" hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" background_position=\"left top\" background_repeat=\"no-repeat\" hover_type=\"none\" border_style=\"solid\" border_position=\"all\" margin_bottom=\"60px\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\" last=\"true\" first=\"true\" border_sizes_top=\"0px\" border_sizes_bottom=\"0px\" border_sizes_left=\"0px\" border_sizes_right=\"0px\" background_blend_mode=\"overlay\" min_height=\"\" link=\"\"][fusion_title hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" size=\"2\" content_align=\"center\" style_type=\"default\" text_transform=\"capitalize\"]increase your conversions[/fusion_title][fusion_text content_alignment=\"center\" hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" sticky_display=\"normal,sticky\" fusion_font_family_text_font=\"var(--awb-typography2-font-family)\" fusion_font_variant_text_font=\"var(--awb-typography2)\" font_size=\"var(--awb-typography2-font-size)\" line_height=\"var(--awb-typography2-line-height)\" letter_spacing=\"var(--awb-typography2-letter-spacing)\" text_transform=\"var(--awb-typography2-text-transform)\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\" animation_delay=\"0\"]\r\n<p>PPC, or Pay-Per-Click, is a form of digital advertising that allows businesses to reach their target audience through online advertising platforms like Google Ads, Bing Ads, and social media networks. As a full-service digital marketing agency, we offer comprehensive PPC services that are designed to help our clients achieve their marketing goals.</p>\r\n[/fusion_text][/fusion_builder_column][fusion_builder_column type=\"1_1\" type=\"1_1\" layout=\"1_1\" center_content=\"no\" target=\"_self\" hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" background_position=\"left top\" background_repeat=\"no-repeat\" hover_type=\"none\" border_style=\"solid\" border_position=\"all\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\" last=\"true\" first=\"true\" border_sizes_top=\"0px\" border_sizes_bottom=\"0px\" border_sizes_left=\"0px\" border_sizes_right=\"0px\" background_blend_mode=\"overlay\" min_height=\"\" link=\"\"][fusion_content_boxes layout=\"icon-on-side\" columns=\"2\" icon_align=\"left\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\" animation_delay=\"0\" hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" heading_size=\"2\" icon=\"fusion-prefix-icon-seo-star-solid\" iconspin=\"no\" icon_circle=\"no\" circlecolor=\"rgba(233,30,99,0)\" circlebordersize=\"0\" circlebordercolor=\"rgba(51,51,51,0)\"][fusion_content_box title=\"Campaign Planning &amp; Strategy: \" icon=\"fusion-prefix-icon-seo-chart-line-solid\" iconspin=\"no\" image_max_width=\"35\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\"]\r\n<p>We start by understanding your business goals and target audience. Our team of experts then creates a tailored PPC strategy that aligns with your objectives and budget.</p>\r\n[/fusion_content_box][fusion_content_box title=\"Keyword Research\" icon=\"fusion-prefix-icon-seo-search-solid\" iconspin=\"no\" image_max_width=\"35\" linktext=\"Read More\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\"]\r\n<p>We research the most relevant keywords for your business and create ad groups based on those keywords to ensure your ads are seen by the right people at the right time.</p>\r\n[/fusion_content_box][fusion_content_box title=\"Ad Creation\" icon=\"fusion-prefix-icon-seo-pencil-alt-solid\" iconspin=\"no\" image_max_width=\"35\" linktext=\"Read More\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\"]\r\n<p>We create eye-catching, high-converting ads that will grab the attention of your target audience. Our team of copywriters and designers will craft ads that resonate with your audience and drive them to take action.</p>\r\n[/fusion_content_box][fusion_content_box title=\"Bid Management\" icon=\"fusion-prefix-icon-seo-cog-solid\" iconspin=\"no\" image_max_width=\"35\" linktext=\"Read More\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\"]\r\n<p>We use sophisticated bid management tools to optimize your ad spend and ensure that you are getting the best possible return on investment (ROI) for your PPC campaigns.</p>\r\n[/fusion_content_box][fusion_content_box title=\"Landing Page Optimization\" icon=\"fusion-prefix-icon-seo-road-solid\" iconspin=\"no\" image_max_width=\"35\" linktext=\"Read More\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\"]\r\n<p>A well-designed landing page can make all the difference in the success of a PPC campaign. Our team will work with you to create landing pages that are optimized for conversion and provide a seamless user experience.</p>\r\n[/fusion_content_box][fusion_content_box title=\"Conversion Tracking\" icon=\"fusion-prefix-icon-seo-chart-bar-solid\" iconspin=\"no\" image_max_width=\"35\" linktext=\"Read More\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\"]\r\n<p>Our team will set up conversion tracking so that you can see exactly how your PPC campaigns are performing and make data-driven decisions to improve their effectiveness.</p>\r\n[/fusion_content_box][fusion_content_box title=\"Reporting &amp; Analytics\" icon=\"fusion-prefix-icon-seo-heartbeat-solid\" iconspin=\"no\" image_max_width=\"35\" linktext=\"Read More\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\"]\r\n<p>Our team will provide regular reports and analysis to help you understand the performance of your PPC campaigns and make informed decisions about how to optimize them for better results.</p>\r\n[/fusion_content_box][/fusion_content_boxes][/fusion_builder_column][/fusion_builder_row][/fusion_builder_container][fusion_builder_container admin_label=\"Brand Strategy\" hundred_percent=\"no\" hundred_percent_height=\"no\" hundred_percent_height_scroll=\"yes\" hundred_percent_height_center_content=\"yes\" equal_height_columns=\"yes\" hide_on_mobile=\"no\" background_color=\"var(--awb-color2)\" background_position=\"left top\" background_repeat=\"no-repeat\" fade=\"no\" background_parallax=\"none\" enable_mobile=\"no\" parallax_speed=\"0.3\" video_aspect_ratio=\"16:9\" video_loop=\"yes\" video_mute=\"yes\" border_style=\"solid\" padding_top=\"80px\" padding_bottom=\"90px\" admin_toggled=\"yes\" border_sizes_top=\"0px\" border_sizes_bottom=\"0px\" border_sizes_left=\"0px\" border_sizes_right=\"0px\" flex_align_items=\"center\" type=\"flex\"][fusion_builder_row][fusion_builder_column type=\"1_2\" type=\"1_2\" layout=\"1_2\" spacing=\"9%\" center_content=\"yes\" target=\"_self\" hide_on_mobile=\"no\" background_position=\"left top\" background_repeat=\"no-repeat\" hover_type=\"none\" border_style=\"solid\" border_position=\"all\" margin_top=\"30px\" animation_direction=\"down\" animation_speed=\"0.1\" last=\"false\" first=\"true\" align_content=\"center\" border_sizes_top=\"0px\" border_sizes_bottom=\"0px\" border_sizes_left=\"0px\" border_sizes_right=\"0px\" spacing_right=\"4.5%\" background_blend_mode=\"overlay\" min_height=\"\" link=\"\"][fusion_title title_type=\"text\" rotation_effect=\"bounceIn\" display_time=\"1200\" highlight_effect=\"circle\" loop_animation=\"off\" highlight_width=\"9\" highlight_top_margin=\"0\" title_link=\"off\" link_target=\"_self\" hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" sticky_display=\"normal,sticky\" content_align=\"left\" size=\"2\" text_transform=\"capitalize\" text_shadow=\"no\" text_shadow_blur=\"0\" gradient_font=\"no\" gradient_start_position=\"0\" gradient_end_position=\"100\" gradient_type=\"linear\" radial_direction=\"center center\" linear_angle=\"180\" style_type=\"default\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\" animation_delay=\"0\"]\r\n<p><strong>Always Remains On Top Position with PPC Services by Web Media Solutions</strong></p>\r\n[/fusion_title][fusion_separator style_type=\"none\" hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" top_margin=\"15px\" alignment=\"center\" /][fusion_text hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" sticky_display=\"normal,sticky\" fusion_font_family_text_font=\"var(--awb-typography2-font-family)\" fusion_font_variant_text_font=\"var(--awb-typography2)\" font_size=\"var(--awb-typography2-font-size)\" line_height=\"var(--awb-typography2-line-height)\" letter_spacing=\"var(--awb-typography2-letter-spacing)\" text_transform=\"var(--awb-typography2-text-transform)\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\" animation_delay=\"0\"]\r\n<p>Excellent Pay per Click services are crucial for helping online businesses succeed in all major web crawls, including Google, Yahoo, MSN, and others, in today\'s fiercely competitive industry. For the top PPC Company like us at Web Media Solutions, our goal is to offer our clients the most thorough PPC management approach possible in order to help them save time, enhance the execution of their web advertising, and boost the effectiveness of their investment by reducing expenses.</p>\r\n<p>Our services are made to produce excellent results more quickly. We provide fully customizable, accountable, and adaptable PPC services that can improve a website\'s search engine rankings and attract more visitors. Once your PPC campaign is live with the search engines, your Ad will be visible on the search engine results page. You must include details about your willingness to pay per click in the campaign. By doing this, you\'ll be able to easily outbid your rivals and ensure that your Ad appears first. Visit our website for additional information.</p>\r\n[/fusion_text][fusion_separator style_type=\"none\" hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" top_margin=\"15px\" alignment=\"center\" /][fusion_text hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" sticky_display=\"normal,sticky\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\" animation_delay=\"0\"]\r\n<p>In their capacity as a Google advertisements agency, internet marketing experts research the keywords that are relevant to your company and then compete for ad space on Google and other top web crawlers. Consequently, your website appears at the top of the search engine results page when a web user types in a keyword related to your business on Google or another web crawler.</p>\r\n[/fusion_text][/fusion_builder_column][fusion_builder_column type=\"1_2\" type=\"1_2\" layout=\"1_2\" spacing=\"9%\" center_content=\"yes\" target=\"_self\" hide_on_mobile=\"no\" background_position=\"left top\" background_repeat=\"no-repeat\" hover_type=\"none\" border_style=\"solid\" border_position=\"all\" margin_top=\"30px\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.1\" last=\"true\" first=\"false\" align_content=\"center\" border_sizes_top=\"0px\" border_sizes_bottom=\"0px\" border_sizes_left=\"0px\" border_sizes_right=\"0px\" spacing_left=\"4.5%\" background_blend_mode=\"overlay\" min_height=\"\" link=\"\"][fusion_imageframe image_id=\"913\" style_type=\"none\" hover_type=\"none\" align=\"center\" lightbox=\"no\" linktarget=\"_self\" hide_on_mobile=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\"]http://webmediasolutionz.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/what-we-do-service-5.jpg[/fusion_imageframe][/fusion_builder_column][/fusion_builder_row][/fusion_builder_container][fusion_builder_container admin_label=\"Measure your visits\" type=\"flex\" hundred_percent=\"no\" hundred_percent_height=\"no\" hundred_percent_height_scroll=\"no\" align_content=\"stretch\" flex_align_items=\"flex-start\" flex_justify_content=\"flex-start\" hundred_percent_height_center_content=\"yes\" equal_height_columns=\"no\" container_tag=\"div\" hide_on_mobile=\"large-visibility\" status=\"published\" padding_top=\"80px\" padding_bottom=\"5%\" border_sizes_top=\"0px\" border_sizes_right=\"0px\" border_sizes_bottom=\"0px\" border_sizes_left=\"0px\" border_style=\"solid\" box_shadow=\"no\" box_shadow_blur=\"0\" box_shadow_spread=\"0\" gradient_start_position=\"0\" gradient_end_position=\"100\" gradient_type=\"linear\" radial_direction=\"center center\" linear_angle=\"180\" background_position=\"left top\" background_repeat=\"no-repeat\" fade=\"no\" background_parallax=\"none\" enable_mobile=\"no\" parallax_speed=\"0.3\" background_blend_mode=\"none\" video_aspect_ratio=\"16:9\" video_loop=\"yes\" video_mute=\"yes\" pattern_bg=\"none\" pattern_bg_style=\"default\" pattern_bg_opacity=\"100\" pattern_bg_blend_mode=\"normal\" mask_bg=\"none\" mask_bg_style=\"default\" mask_bg_opacity=\"100\" mask_bg_transform=\"left\" mask_bg_blend_mode=\"normal\" absolute=\"off\" absolute_devices=\"small,medium,large\" sticky=\"off\" sticky_devices=\"small-visibility,medium-visibility,large-visibility\" sticky_transition_offset=\"0\" scroll_offset=\"0\" animation_direction=\"left\" animation_speed=\"0.3\" animation_delay=\"0\" filter_hue=\"0\" filter_saturation=\"100\" filter_brightness=\"100\" filter_contrast=\"100\" filter_invert=\"0\" filter_s